<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:23.400" end="00:00:27.900" style="s2">15 million naira my groom paid for every</p>
<p begin="00:00:26.000" end="00:00:30.300" style="s2">bead. Look at the sleeves. Look how the</p>
<p begin="00:00:27.900" end="00:00:32.800" style="s2">light sits on them.</p>
<p begin="00:00:30.300" end="00:00:35.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zara, stand up.</p>
<p begin="00:00:32.800" end="00:00:35.700" style="s2">Show them the back.</p>
<p begin="00:00:39.100" end="00:00:43.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Two hands, mama.</p>
<p begin="00:00:40.900" end="00:00:44.700" style="s2">That gown is worth more than this house</p>
<p begin="00:00:43.200" end="00:00:47.200" style="s2">and she will remind us of it until</p>
<p begin="00:00:44.700" end="00:00:47.200" style="s2">Saturday.</p>
<p begin="00:00:48.100" end="00:00:52.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Two hands. I have carried heavier things</p>
<p begin="00:00:50.000" end="00:00:54.900" style="s2">than soup, my dear.</p>
<p begin="00:00:52.100" end="00:00:57.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Babe, 3,000 people are watching. Say</p>
<p begin="00:00:54.900" end="00:00:59.300" style="s2">something to the haters. [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:00:57.500" end="00:01:01.400" style="s2">Babes, tell them who is the bride of the</p>
<p begin="00:00:59.300" end="00:01:03.100" style="s2">year.</p>
<p begin="00:01:01.400" end="00:01:06.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zara,</p>
<p begin="00:01:03.100" end="00:01:06.400" style="s2">bride of the year.</p>
<p begin="00:01:08.700" end="00:01:12.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To my haters, keep watching. On</p>
<p begin="00:01:10.500" end="00:01:13.800" style="s2">Saturday, you will need sunglasses.</p>
<p begin="00:01:12.200" end="00:01:16.200" style="s2">Mama, bring the soup here. My guests are</p>
<p begin="00:01:13.800" end="00:01:16.200" style="s2">hungry.</p>
<p begin="00:01:25.400" end="00:01:30.600" style="s2">It is hot. It is on my skin. My beads,</p>
<p begin="00:01:28.200" end="00:01:31.400" style="s2">my beads are drinking it.</p>
<p begin="00:01:30.600" end="00:01:34.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jesus!</p>
<p begin="00:01:31.400" end="00:01:34.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jesus! The gown!</p>
<p begin="00:01:43.000" end="00:01:47.700" style="s2">You village hands, do you know what you</p>
<p begin="00:01:45.000" end="00:01:47.700" style="s2">just poured on?</p>
<p begin="00:02:02.492" end="00:02:07.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at my gown. Look what this woman</p>
<p begin="00:02:04.792" end="00:02:07.492" style="s2">did to me.</p>
<p begin="00:02:09.292" end="00:02:13.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who let this woman near your gown? Who</p>
<p begin="00:02:11.192" end="00:02:15.992" style="s2">hired her? Is this how the agency trains</p>
<p begin="00:02:13.492" end="00:02:15.992" style="s2">them now?</p>
<p begin="00:02:16.792" end="00:02:21.692" style="s2">My husband pays good money and they send</p>
<p begin="00:02:18.892" end="00:02:25.792" style="s2">us a woman with shaking hands.</p>
<p begin="00:02:21.692" end="00:02:25.792" style="s2">Stop it. Delete it now.</p>
<p begin="00:02:31.592" end="00:02:37.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zara, it was an accident. It is raining</p>
<p begin="00:02:34.192" end="00:02:37.992" style="s2">and she has nowhere to go tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:02:38.892" end="00:02:42.692" style="s2">Let her sleep in the kitchen. I will</p>
<p begin="00:02:40.592" end="00:02:44.092" style="s2">watch her myself.</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.692" end="00:02:45.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, please.</p>
<p begin="00:02:44.092" end="00:02:48.092" style="s2">Even a dog is brought inside in this</p>
<p begin="00:02:45.792" end="00:02:50.392" style="s2">weather.</p>
<p begin="00:02:48.092" end="00:02:53.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zara, is this one your sister?</p>
<p begin="00:02:50.392" end="00:02:56.196" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She is not my sister. She is the girl my</p>
<p begin="00:02:53.092" end="00:02:58.216" style="s2">father brought home with a pot.</p>
<p begin="00:02:56.196" end="00:02:58.216" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:03:06.892" end="00:03:11.092" style="s2">Let the rain teach her how to carry</p>
<p begin="00:03:08.692" end="00:03:11.092" style="s2">soup.</p>
<p begin="00:03:16.692" end="00:03:20.292" style="s2">Majini, you jest.</p>
<p begin="00:03:21.492" end="00:03:26.292" style="s2">If one drop of that soup is still on it,</p>
<p begin="00:03:24.292" end="00:03:28.792" style="s2">you and your mother&#39;s pot are on the</p>
<p begin="00:03:26.292" end="00:03:28.792" style="s2">street.</p>
<p begin="00:03:30.292" end="00:03:34.292" style="s2">Zara, these are crystals. Water can</p>
<p begin="00:03:32.492" end="00:03:36.492" style="s2">spoil them. Let the dry</p>
<p begin="00:03:34.292" end="00:03:39.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did I ask you for a lecture?</p>
<p begin="00:03:36.492" end="00:03:39.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; By morning.</p>
<p begin="00:04:01.892" end="00:04:08.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lady Nneoma, enough now. Let me break</p>
<p begin="00:04:04.894" end="00:04:08.594" style="s2">this padlock and carry you home.</p>
<p begin="00:04:09.394" end="00:04:15.394" style="s2">The woman we they feed half of London,</p>
<p begin="00:04:11.594" end="00:04:15.394" style="s2">they stand inside rain like a goat.</p>
<p begin="00:04:19.494" end="00:04:24.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leave the padlock.</p>
<p begin="00:04:21.494" end="00:04:26.794" style="s2">My son marries that girl on Saturday</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.794" end="00:04:28.994" style="s2">and I have only seen one side of her</p>
<p begin="00:04:26.794" end="00:04:30.894" style="s2">hand.</p>
<p begin="00:04:28.994" end="00:04:32.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma, she slap you?</p>
<p begin="00:04:30.894" end="00:04:34.494" style="s2">For 20 years I they drive you, nobody</p>
<p begin="00:04:32.594" end="00:04:37.194" style="s2">touch your face. Make I go inside small</p>
<p begin="00:04:34.494" end="00:04:37.194" style="s2">just to greet her.</p>
<p begin="00:04:39.294" end="00:04:42.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You will greet her on Saturday like</p>
<p begin="00:04:40.994" end="00:04:44.894" style="s2">everybody else.</p>
<p begin="00:04:42.694" end="00:04:46.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma, your blood pressure. That London</p>
<p begin="00:04:44.894" end="00:04:49.094" style="s2">doctor talk say no stress, no rain, no</p>
<p begin="00:04:46.794" end="00:04:53.394" style="s2">wahala.</p>
<p begin="00:04:49.094" end="00:04:53.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then stop stressing me and let me work.</p>
<p begin="00:04:54.494" end="00:04:59.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At least take the umbrella ma, your hair</p>
<p begin="00:04:56.494" end="00:04:59.094" style="s2">go spoil.</p>
<p begin="00:04:59.494" end="00:05:03.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A maid does not own an umbrella.</p>
<p begin="00:05:03.594" end="00:05:06.394" style="s2">Go back to the car.</p>
<p begin="00:05:09.094" end="00:05:15.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then at least hide the ring ma.</p>
<p begin="00:05:11.494" end="00:05:15.294" style="s2">Maid uniform no they wear diamond.</p>
<p begin="00:05:39.694" end="00:05:43.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama come quick before mummy sees the</p>
<p begin="00:05:41.394" end="00:05:45.294" style="s2">light.</p>
<p begin="00:05:43.394" end="00:05:46.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go back inside my dear.</p>
<p begin="00:05:45.294" end="00:05:49.394" style="s2">If they see you with me, they will</p>
<p begin="00:05:46.894" end="00:05:51.594" style="s2">punish you.</p>
<p begin="00:05:49.394" end="00:05:53.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then they will punish me dry.</p>
<p begin="00:05:51.594" end="00:05:55.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come, the biqu is warm and I have a</p>
<p begin="00:05:53.394" end="00:05:55.794" style="s2">towel.</p>
<p begin="00:06:00.494" end="00:06:04.394" style="s2">You do not even know my name my dear.</p>
<p begin="00:06:09.295" end="00:06:14.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know you are wet. Names can wait until</p>
<p begin="00:06:12.495" end="00:06:15.795" style="s2">you are dry.</p>
<p begin="00:06:14.695" end="00:06:17.495" style="s2">Mama,</p>
<p begin="00:06:15.795" end="00:06:19.195" style="s2">please, my feet are standing in the</p>
<p begin="00:06:17.495" end="00:06:20.895" style="s2">water.</p>
<p begin="00:06:19.195" end="00:06:22.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That woman with the glasses is your</p>
<p begin="00:06:20.895" end="00:06:24.595" style="s2">mother?</p>
<p begin="00:06:22.895" end="00:06:26.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She married my father.</p>
<p begin="00:06:24.595" end="00:06:29.395" style="s2">Come, mama.</p>
<p begin="00:06:26.395" end="00:06:29.395" style="s2">Your cheek is swelling.</p>
<p begin="00:06:46.759" end="00:06:48.779" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:06:51.895" end="00:06:56.495" style="s2">Change into this.</p>
<p begin="00:06:53.695" end="00:06:56.495" style="s2">But it is dry.</p>
<p begin="00:07:00.295" end="00:07:04.795" style="s2">And you will take the bed. I sleep on</p>
<p begin="00:07:02.395" end="00:07:08.095" style="s2">the mat. I am used to it.</p>
<p begin="00:07:04.795" end="00:07:10.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I cannot take a young woman&#39;s bed.</p>
<p begin="00:07:08.095" end="00:07:12.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can because I am the one saying it.</p>
<p begin="00:07:10.995" end="00:07:13.695" style="s2">Sit.</p>
<p begin="00:07:12.195" end="00:07:16.195" style="s2">Hold still. Your hair is dripping into</p>
<p begin="00:07:13.695" end="00:07:16.195" style="s2">your eyes.</p>
<p begin="00:07:17.395" end="00:07:23.195" style="s2">You carried it all the way to the table.</p>
<p begin="00:07:19.995" end="00:07:23.195" style="s2">You should at least taste it.</p>
<p begin="00:07:24.295" end="00:07:26.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hmm.</p>
<p begin="00:07:27.595" end="00:07:32.195" style="s2">Who taught you to cook it with the oil</p>
<p begin="00:07:29.395" end="00:07:33.995" style="s2">this patient?</p>
<p begin="00:07:32.195" end="00:07:35.595" style="s2">Nobody in a hurry makes it taste like</p>
<p begin="00:07:33.995" end="00:07:38.095" style="s2">this.</p>
<p begin="00:07:35.595" end="00:07:41.595" style="s2">My dear, people would pay for this in</p>
<p begin="00:07:38.095" end="00:07:41.595" style="s2">places you would not believe.</p>
<p begin="00:07:42.995" end="00:07:47.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My mother</p>
<p begin="00:07:45.295" end="00:07:49.395" style="s2">That ladle was hers.</p>
<p begin="00:07:47.295" end="00:07:53.095" style="s2">She burnt the notch the day I was born.</p>
<p begin="00:07:49.395" end="00:07:54.995" style="s2">She said she forgot the pot to hold me.</p>
<p begin="00:07:53.095" end="00:07:56.895" style="s2">Tell me something, my dear.</p>
<p begin="00:07:54.995" end="00:07:59.495" style="s2">Everybody in that kitchen stood still</p>
<p begin="00:07:56.895" end="00:07:59.495" style="s2">tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:08:00.095" end="00:08:03.995" style="s2">Why did you open your door?</p>
<p begin="00:08:02.095" end="00:08:07.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My mother used to say</p>
<p begin="00:08:03.995" end="00:08:07.497" style="s2">rain shows you who is family.</p>
<p begin="00:08:14.397" end="00:08:20.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why is your lamp still on at this hour?</p>
<p begin="00:08:18.097" end="00:08:22.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am starting the gown, mommy.</p>
<p begin="00:08:20.697" end="00:08:24.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; By morning,</p>
<p begin="00:08:22.297" end="00:08:26.597" style="s2">or the street, you and that pot</p>
<p begin="00:08:24.197" end="00:08:26.597" style="s2">together.</p>
<p begin="00:08:28.597" end="00:08:31.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do I call you, ma?</p>
<p begin="00:08:32.297" end="00:08:38.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama is enough.</p>
<p begin="00:08:35.297" end="00:08:38.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The agency says mama.</p>
<p begin="00:08:53.197" end="00:08:57.797" style="s2">Palm oil runs from cold water. Hot water</p>
<p begin="00:08:55.597" end="00:09:00.497" style="s2">cooks it into the cloth, and then it is</p>
<p begin="00:08:57.797" end="00:09:04.297" style="s2">yours forever.</p>
<p begin="00:09:00.497" end="00:09:04.297" style="s2">Let me help you. Give me a sleeve.</p>
<p begin="00:09:09.297" end="00:09:12.297" style="s2">Mama,</p>
<p begin="00:09:10.597" end="00:09:14.897" style="s2">you ring like somebody who has never</p>
<p begin="00:09:12.297" end="00:09:18.097" style="s2">washed anything in her life.</p>
<p begin="00:09:14.897" end="00:09:20.197" style="s2">Those are crystals, not cassava.</p>
<p begin="00:09:18.097" end="00:09:21.997" style="s2">Where I worked before, the machine did</p>
<p begin="00:09:20.197" end="00:09:23.997" style="s2">the washing.</p>
<p begin="00:09:21.997" end="00:09:28.097" style="s2">Then the machine was lucky. Hold the</p>
<p begin="00:09:23.997" end="00:09:28.097" style="s2">torch for me. That one you can do.</p>
<p begin="00:09:30.597" end="00:09:36.397" style="s2">You are washing the inside too?</p>
<p begin="00:09:32.997" end="00:09:36.397" style="s2">Nobody looks inside a gown.</p>
<p begin="00:09:36.597" end="00:09:40.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I look.</p>
<p begin="00:09:38.397" end="00:09:43.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If the soap stays in the lining, the</p>
<p begin="00:09:40.297" end="00:09:43.997" style="s2">cloth goes yellow by Saturday.</p>
<p begin="00:09:46.797" end="00:09:51.197" style="s2">Bell Rose Bridal, hire number 219,</p>
<p begin="00:09:49.597" end="00:09:52.997" style="s2">return Monday.</p>
<p begin="00:09:51.197" end="00:09:54.897" style="s2">Mama, why does a 15 million gown have a</p>
<p begin="00:09:52.997" end="00:09:57.297" style="s2">number inside, like a rented chair at a</p>
<p begin="00:09:54.897" end="00:09:57.297" style="s2">party?</p>
<p begin="00:09:58.897" end="00:10:02.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 15 million.</p>
<p begin="00:10:00.597" end="00:10:04.797" style="s2">That is what my what the groom paid for</p>
<p begin="00:10:02.597" end="00:10:04.797" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:10:06.397" end="00:10:09.197" style="s2">That is what she told the whole</p>
<p begin="00:10:07.697" end="00:10:11.498" style="s2">internet.</p>
<p begin="00:10:09.197" end="00:10:13.398" style="s2">Every bead, she said.</p>
<p begin="00:10:11.498" end="00:10:15.398" style="s2">You heard her.</p>
<p begin="00:10:13.398" end="00:10:18.098" style="s2">And a gown that was bought does not go</p>
<p begin="00:10:15.398" end="00:10:18.098" style="s2">back on Monday.</p>
<p begin="00:10:22.598" end="00:10:29.098" style="s2">It is not my business, mama.</p>
<p begin="00:10:25.698" end="00:10:29.098" style="s2">My business is the stain.</p>
<p begin="00:10:30.198" end="00:10:36.098" style="s2">If the stain is here in the morning,</p>
<p begin="00:10:32.498" end="00:10:36.098" style="s2">my mother&#39;s pot is on the street.</p>
<p begin="00:10:50.498" end="00:10:54.998" style="s2">Sir, it is 1:00 in the morning. I said</p>
<p begin="00:10:52.498" end="00:10:57.998" style="s2">Monday. Monday at noon, you get your 60</p>
<p begin="00:10:54.998" end="00:10:57.998" style="s2">million every kobo.</p>
<p begin="00:11:01.398" end="00:11:04.898" style="s2">Because his mother gives me the house</p>
<p begin="00:11:02.898" end="00:11:07.498" style="s2">key on the wedding morning. A whole</p>
<p begin="00:11:04.898" end="00:11:09.498" style="s2">house, sir, in GRA.</p>
<p begin="00:11:07.498" end="00:11:13.298" style="s2">She promised it to her son&#39;s wife. Once</p>
<p begin="00:11:09.498" end="00:11:13.298" style="s2">I am his wife, the key is mine.</p>
<p begin="00:11:16.798" end="00:11:21.398" style="s2">The gown, the gown is handled.</p>
<p begin="00:11:19.398" end="00:11:23.098" style="s2">No, sir, do not call him. He does not</p>
<p begin="00:11:21.398" end="00:11:24.698" style="s2">know anything and he will not know</p>
<p begin="00:11:23.098" end="00:11:26.798" style="s2">anything.</p>
<p begin="00:11:24.698" end="00:11:29.698" style="s2">Just come to the wedding and smile in</p>
<p begin="00:11:26.798" end="00:11:29.698" style="s2">the photographs.</p>
<p begin="00:11:32.798" end="00:11:37.998" style="s2">Lower your voice.</p>
<p begin="00:11:34.498" end="00:11:41.498" style="s2">The walls in this compound have ears.</p>
<p begin="00:11:37.998" end="00:11:41.498" style="s2">Who are you shouting at by this time?</p>
<p begin="00:11:41.798" end="00:11:47.198" style="s2">Mommy, relax. Two more days and I will</p>
<p begin="00:11:43.698" end="00:11:47.198" style="s2">never shout at anybody again.</p>
<p begin="00:11:47.998" end="00:11:52.598" style="s2">Then smile for two more days.</p>
<p begin="00:11:50.298" end="00:11:54.998" style="s2">Smile at the groom, smile at that</p>
<p begin="00:11:52.598" end="00:11:54.998" style="s2">pastor.</p>
<p begin="00:11:56.198" end="00:12:01.698" style="s2">Only the cook has ears in this yard and</p>
<p begin="00:11:58.398" end="00:12:01.698" style="s2">she is asleep with her pot.</p>
<p begin="00:12:26.199" end="00:12:30.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good morning, my daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:12:28.199" end="00:12:32.299" style="s2">It is your mother&#39;s taste</p>
<p begin="00:12:30.499" end="00:12:35.199" style="s2">every time.</p>
<p begin="00:12:32.299" end="00:12:37.199" style="s2">Sit, eat with me, small.</p>
<p begin="00:12:35.199" end="00:12:39.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Customers do not invite the cook to sit</p>
<p begin="00:12:37.199" end="00:12:41.699" style="s2">down, papa.</p>
