<p begin="00:24:08.806" end="00:24:13.706" style="s2">A key promised to his wife on her</p>
<p begin="00:24:11.006" end="00:24:15.606" style="s2">wedding morning.</p>
<p begin="00:24:13.706" end="00:24:18.106" style="s2">And this,</p>
<p begin="00:24:15.606" end="00:24:21.006" style="s2">it fell out of your apron pocket when I</p>
<p begin="00:24:18.106" end="00:24:24.506" style="s2">rinsed it this morning.</p>
<p begin="00:24:21.006" end="00:24:26.906" style="s2">First, I thought maybe she stole it.</p>
<p begin="00:24:24.506" end="00:24:28.607" style="s2">Then I thought, a thief does not leave a</p>
<p begin="00:24:26.906" end="00:24:30.408" style="s2">diamond in the</p>
<p begin="00:24:28.607" end="00:24:31.908" style="s2">You are his mother,</p>
<p begin="00:24:30.408" end="00:24:34.107" style="s2">Kenna&#39;s mother.</p>
<p begin="00:24:31.908" end="00:24:34.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:24:40.007" end="00:24:43.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And I gave you the wrapper with the hole</p>
<p begin="00:24:41.908" end="00:24:45.612" style="s2">in it.</p>
<p begin="00:24:43.592" end="00:24:45.612" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:24:47.507" end="00:24:51.507" style="s2">I gave the groom&#39;s mother my enamel</p>
<p begin="00:24:49.408" end="00:24:53.707" style="s2">bowl. [laughter] I told her she wrings</p>
<p begin="00:24:51.507" end="00:24:57.207" style="s2">crystals like cassava.</p>
<p begin="00:24:53.707" end="00:24:59.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You also told her to hold the torch.</p>
<p begin="00:24:57.207" end="00:25:00.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I held it very well.</p>
<p begin="00:24:59.107" end="00:25:01.307" style="s2">Tell her.</p>
<p begin="00:25:00.207" end="00:25:03.607" style="s2">Tell him.</p>
<p begin="00:25:01.307" end="00:25:05.107" style="s2">Today, mama, take off this apron, walk</p>
<p begin="00:25:03.607" end="00:25:07.307" style="s2">into that house and tell them who you</p>
<p begin="00:25:05.107" end="00:25:07.307" style="s2">are.</p>
<p begin="00:25:08.207" end="00:25:14.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If Zara knows who I am,</p>
<p begin="00:25:10.408" end="00:25:17.207" style="s2">she will wear a sweet face for one day</p>
<p begin="00:25:14.107" end="00:25:19.707" style="s2">and my son will marry a mask.</p>
<p begin="00:25:17.207" end="00:25:21.507" style="s2">And Kenna will not take my word,</p>
<p begin="00:25:19.707" end="00:25:24.507" style="s2">not after Bola,</p>
<p begin="00:25:21.507" end="00:25:26.908" style="s2">a girl he loved.</p>
<p begin="00:25:24.507" end="00:25:29.607" style="s2">I tested her once and he has not</p>
<p begin="00:25:26.908" end="00:25:29.607" style="s2">forgiven me.</p>
<p begin="00:25:31.007" end="00:25:35.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So when he sits on my bench, I smile and</p>
<p begin="00:25:32.908" end="00:25:38.207" style="s2">say nothing?</p>
<p begin="00:25:35.307" end="00:25:41.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Say nothing until the wedding.</p>
<p begin="00:25:38.207" end="00:25:41.307" style="s2">One more day, my dear.</p>
<p begin="00:25:43.307" end="00:25:47.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One condition, mama.</p>
<p begin="00:25:45.307" end="00:25:51.307" style="s2">At 10:00 tomorrow, before anybody says I</p>
<p begin="00:25:47.607" end="00:25:51.307" style="s2">do, you tell him yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:25:54.987" end="00:25:59.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:25:56.307" end="00:25:59.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At 10:00 tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:26:11.807" end="00:26:17.908" style="s2">Four pots for 150 guests, mama, and not</p>
<p begin="00:26:14.707" end="00:26:17.908" style="s2">one naira for the cook.</p>
<p begin="00:26:18.507" end="00:26:22.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama, why soup?</p>
<p begin="00:26:20.607" end="00:26:25.507" style="s2">Of all the things in the world,</p>
<p begin="00:26:22.707" end="00:26:25.507" style="s2">why her gown?</p>
<p begin="00:26:30.908" end="00:26:35.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When I was 19, I was a maid in a house</p>
<p begin="00:26:33.409" end="00:26:37.609" style="s2">in GRA.</p>
<p begin="00:26:35.509" end="00:26:39.309" style="s2">This same city.</p>
<p begin="00:26:37.609" end="00:26:42.809" style="s2">In my first week,</p>
<p begin="00:26:39.309" end="00:26:44.309" style="s2">I carried soup to my madam&#39;s table.</p>
<p begin="00:26:42.809" end="00:26:46.309" style="s2">My hand shook,</p>
<p begin="00:26:44.309" end="00:26:48.209" style="s2">and it fell on her lace.</p>
<p begin="00:26:46.309" end="00:26:49.709" style="s2">By accident.</p>
<p begin="00:26:48.209" end="00:26:53.609" style="s2">By accident.</p>
<p begin="00:26:49.709" end="00:26:53.609" style="s2">She slapped me in front of her guests.</p>
<p begin="00:26:55.009" end="00:27:00.409" style="s2">Then she put me out of the back door</p>
<p begin="00:26:56.709" end="00:27:00.409" style="s2">into the rain and bolted it.</p>
<p begin="00:27:04.209" end="00:27:07.309" style="s2">I stood there until I could not feel my</p>
<p begin="00:27:06.109" end="00:27:09.609" style="s2">feet.</p>
<p begin="00:27:07.309" end="00:27:11.009" style="s2">Nobody came.</p>
<p begin="00:27:09.609" end="00:27:12.609" style="s2">Not the cook,</p>
<p begin="00:27:11.009" end="00:27:13.709" style="s2">not the driver,</p>
<p begin="00:27:12.609" end="00:27:16.109" style="s2">nobody.</p>
<p begin="00:27:13.709" end="00:27:17.709" style="s2">Where did you go?</p>
<p begin="00:27:16.109" end="00:27:19.109" style="s2">I walked.</p>
<p begin="00:27:17.709" end="00:27:23.109" style="s2">At the junction, there was a woman</p>
<p begin="00:27:19.109" end="00:27:23.109" style="s2">selling soup under a zinc roof.</p>
<p begin="00:27:24.309" end="00:27:31.409" style="s2">She saw a wet girl with a swollen face,</p>
<p begin="00:27:28.309" end="00:27:35.209" style="s2">and she did not ask my name.</p>
<p begin="00:27:31.409" end="00:27:37.509" style="s2">She dried me with her own wrapper</p>
<p begin="00:27:35.209" end="00:27:39.109" style="s2">and gave me soup.</p>
<p begin="00:27:37.509" end="00:27:41.709" style="s2">The next morning, she put a ladle in my</p>
<p begin="00:27:39.109" end="00:27:43.909" style="s2">hand and said, if you can carry it, you</p>
<p begin="00:27:41.709" end="00:27:46.009" style="s2">can cook it.</p>
<p begin="00:27:43.909" end="00:27:48.409" style="s2">And you cooked.</p>
<p begin="00:27:46.009" end="00:27:49.709" style="s2">Six years at her junction, then one pot</p>
<p begin="00:27:48.409" end="00:27:51.409" style="s2">of my own,</p>
<p begin="00:27:49.709" end="00:27:54.009" style="s2">then a small shop.</p>
<p begin="00:27:51.409" end="00:27:56.509" style="s2">Today, 40 restaurants in London and in</p>
<p begin="00:27:54.009" end="00:27:58.609" style="s2">Lagos.</p>
<p begin="00:27:56.509" end="00:28:02.009" style="s2">40. And this morning, I took two pieces</p>
<p begin="00:27:58.609" end="00:28:02.009" style="s2">of meat back from your hand.</p>
<p begin="00:28:02.609" end="00:28:06.709" style="s2">You were right to.</p>
<p begin="00:28:04.609" end="00:28:09.909" style="s2">Every one of those restaurants began</p>
<p begin="00:28:06.709" end="00:28:09.909" style="s2">with that woman&#39;s door.</p>
<p begin="00:28:12.009" end="00:28:18.109" style="s2">So when my son told me he was getting</p>
<p begin="00:28:14.009" end="00:28:18.109" style="s2">married, I made myself one promise.</p>
<p begin="00:28:19.809" end="00:28:24.709" style="s2">His wife will never be a woman who locks</p>
<p begin="00:28:21.509" end="00:28:24.709" style="s2">an old woman in the rain.</p>
<p begin="00:28:28.209" end="00:28:33.909" style="s2">I did not spill it by accident, Imade.</p>
<p begin="00:28:31.009" end="00:28:33.909" style="s2">I poured it.</p>
<p begin="00:28:35.709" end="00:28:38.410" style="s2">And</p>
<p begin="00:28:35.810" end="00:28:40.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; my door, mama? Was my door part of your</p>
<p begin="00:28:38.410" end="00:28:40.910" style="s2">test?</p>
<p begin="00:28:42.110" end="00:28:48.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The soup was my test. Your door was not.</p>
<p begin="00:28:45.410" end="00:28:52.710" style="s2">Nobody can test a door open.</p>
<p begin="00:28:48.310" end="00:28:52.710" style="s2">It opens by itself or it stays shut.</p>
<p begin="00:29:01.664" end="00:29:03.684" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:29:15.010" end="00:29:19.910" style="s2">Last night, while you slept, I hung the</p>
<p begin="00:29:17.410" end="00:29:23.110" style="s2">gown on this line.</p>
<p begin="00:29:19.910" end="00:29:25.510" style="s2">She was up there on her phone, pacing.</p>
<p begin="00:29:23.110" end="00:29:29.210" style="s2">She never looked down.</p>
<p begin="00:29:25.510" end="00:29:31.110" style="s2">After midnight, a maid is furniture.</p>
<p begin="00:29:29.210" end="00:29:33.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who was she talking to?</p>
<p begin="00:29:31.110" end="00:29:34.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A man she called sir.</p>
<p begin="00:29:33.210" end="00:29:36.410" style="s2">Listen, I will give it to you word for</p>
<p begin="00:29:34.910" end="00:29:38.010" style="s2">word.</p>
<p begin="00:29:36.410" end="00:29:40.210" style="s2">60 million,</p>
<p begin="00:29:38.010" end="00:29:43.710" style="s2">Monday at noon.</p>
<p begin="00:29:40.210" end="00:29:45.910" style="s2">And then this, once I am his wife,</p>
<p begin="00:29:43.710" end="00:29:47.710" style="s2">the key is mine.</p>
<p begin="00:29:45.910" end="00:29:48.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The key Kena asked you about on the</p>
<p begin="00:29:47.710" end="00:29:50.910" style="s2">phone.</p>
<p begin="00:29:48.710" end="00:29:52.810" style="s2">Your key.</p>
<p begin="00:29:50.910" end="00:29:55.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My key.</p>
<p begin="00:29:52.810" end="00:29:58.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then call Kena now, mama. Call him from</p>
<p begin="00:29:55.110" end="00:29:58.710" style="s2">this yard before she comes down.</p>
<p begin="00:30:00.210" end="00:30:04.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With what?</p>
<p begin="00:30:01.710" end="00:30:09.110" style="s2">An old maid&#39;s ears?</p>
<p begin="00:30:04.710" end="00:30:10.810" style="s2">He will say, Mommy, this is Bola again.</p>
<p begin="00:30:09.110" end="00:30:12.910" style="s2">And then he will ask me why his mother</p>
<p begin="00:30:10.810" end="00:30:15.410" style="s2">was hiding under a balcony at 1:00 in</p>
<p begin="00:30:12.910" end="00:30:15.410" style="s2">the morning.</p>
<p begin="00:30:20.110" end="00:30:23.710" style="s2">That house on Ikorodu Road was the first</p>
<p begin="00:30:22.110" end="00:30:27.110" style="s2">thing I ever owned.</p>
<p begin="00:30:23.710" end="00:30:28.710" style="s2">White walls, a mango tree at the gate.</p>
<p begin="00:30:27.110" end="00:30:32.710" style="s2">I bought it so the girl from the</p>
<p begin="00:30:28.710" end="00:30:32.710" style="s2">junction would always have a roof.</p>
<p begin="00:30:33.710" end="00:30:38.912" style="s2">I will not hand it to a</p>
<p begin="00:30:35.712" end="00:30:38.912" style="s2">who would sell it on Monday.</p>
<p begin="00:30:55.512" end="00:31:00.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You look tired, Zara. Brides are</p>
<p begin="00:30:57.512" end="00:31:00.312" style="s2">supposed to glow.</p>
<p begin="00:31:02.412" end="00:31:08.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, you did not need to call me all the</p>
<p begin="00:31:04.812" end="00:31:08.712" style="s2">way up here. I told you Monday.</p>
<p begin="00:31:10.612" end="00:31:15.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 14 million of your groom&#39;s gown money</p>
<p begin="00:31:13.112" end="00:31:18.012" style="s2">paid my interest.</p>
<p begin="00:31:15.212" end="00:31:18.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank him for me.</p>
<p begin="00:31:20.412" end="00:31:24.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But 60 is still 60.</p>
<p begin="00:31:22.712" end="00:31:26.212" style="s2">Monday at noon</p>
<p begin="00:31:24.312" end="00:31:29.212" style="s2">or I visit your groom&#39;s office with your</p>
<p begin="00:31:26.212" end="00:31:29.212" style="s2">signature in my hand.</p>
<p begin="00:31:30.712" end="00:31:33.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You will not need to.</p>
<p begin="00:31:35.012" end="00:31:40.212" style="s2">Ihama Road, GRA, his mother&#39;s first</p>
<p begin="00:31:37.912" end="00:31:42.212" style="s2">house.</p>
<p begin="00:31:40.212" end="00:31:44.712" style="s2">She hands me the key tomorrow on my</p>
<p begin="00:31:42.212" end="00:31:46.712" style="s2">wedding morning.</p>
<p begin="00:31:44.712" end="00:31:50.012" style="s2">The papers follow on Monday. You get</p>
<p begin="00:31:46.712" end="00:31:51.612" style="s2">your money and I get my life back.</p>
<p begin="00:31:50.012" end="00:31:53.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And the mother?</p>
<p begin="00:31:51.612" end="00:31:54.712" style="s2">Mothers have eyes.</p>
<p begin="00:31:53.931" end="00:31:57.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:31:54.712" end="00:32:00.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His mother is in London buying hats. She</p>
<p begin="00:31:57.212" end="00:32:00.312" style="s2">has never even met me.</p>
<p begin="00:32:04.912" end="00:32:10.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I will sit in the third row</p>
<p begin="00:32:06.212" end="00:32:10.612" style="s2">tomorrow and watch my money say I do.</p>
<p begin="00:32:20.712" end="00:32:26.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Row three, wear something quiet.</p>
<p begin="00:32:24.012" end="00:32:26.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I always do.</p>
<p begin="00:32:29.012" end="00:32:34.212" style="s2">If there is no wedding, Zara,</p>
<p begin="00:32:31.412" end="00:32:34.212" style="s2">there is no Zara.</p>
<p begin="00:32:46.613" end="00:32:51.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is that smell? It is not palm oil.</p>
<p begin="00:32:48.913" end="00:32:53.313" style="s2">Tell me mama, which agency pays its</p>
<p begin="00:32:51.113" end="00:32:55.713" style="s2">maids enough for food?</p>
<p begin="00:32:53.313" end="00:32:58.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A madam gave me a bottle once ma</p>
<p begin="00:32:55.713" end="00:32:59.713" style="s2">when she was leaving the country.</p>
<p begin="00:32:58.113" end="00:33:00.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A madam gave you?</p>
<p begin="00:32:59.713" end="00:33:03.313" style="s2">Hm.</p>
<p begin="00:33:00.713" end="00:33:03.313" style="s2">Give me your hand.</p>
<p begin="00:33:06.513" end="00:33:10.413" style="s2">Soft like agege bread.</p>
<p begin="00:33:08.713" end="00:33:12.613" style="s2">These hands have never scrubbed a floor</p>
<p begin="00:33:10.413" end="00:33:16.013" style="s2">in their life.</p>
<p begin="00:33:12.613" end="00:33:18.213" style="s2">God has been kind to my hands ma.</p>
<p begin="00:33:16.013" end="00:33:21.913" style="s2">God is kind to many people.</p>
<p begin="00:33:18.213" end="00:33:21.913" style="s2">He does not usually do their nails.</p>
<p begin="00:33:24.013" end="00:33:28.213" style="s2">And you, after Saturday that kiosk comes</p>
<p begin="00:33:26.913" end="00:33:30.713" style="s2">down.</p>
<p begin="00:33:28.213" end="00:33:32.813" style="s2">I have already called the men.</p>
<p begin="00:33:30.713" end="00:33:36.113" style="s2">My daughter&#39;s wedding photographs will</p>
<p begin="00:33:32.813" end="00:33:37.613" style="s2">not have a soup shed in the corner</p>
<p begin="00:33:36.113" end="00:33:40.113" style="s2">with Okada riders eating in the</p>
<p begin="00:33:37.613" end="00:33:41.213" style="s2">background.</p>
<p begin="00:33:40.113" end="00:33:43.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mummy,</p>
<p begin="00:33:41.213" end="00:33:46.013" style="s2">my mother built it with her own money,</p>
<p begin="00:33:43.313" end="00:33:46.013" style="s2">every plank.</p>
<p begin="00:33:47.248" end="00:33:50.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:33:48.013" end="00:33:52.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your mother is dead.</p>
<p begin="00:33:50.013" end="00:33:55.913" style="s2">The wall is my husband&#39;s.</p>
<p begin="00:33:52.113" end="00:33:55.913" style="s2">Ask your father, he agrees with me.</p>
<p begin="00:33:56.313" end="00:34:00.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I did ask him mummy. He looked into his</p>
<p begin="00:33:58.513" end="00:34:00.813" style="s2">bowl.</p>
<p begin="00:34:13.448" end="00:34:15.468" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:34:25.913" end="00:34:29.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Closed on a Friday?</p>
<p begin="00:34:27.413" end="00:34:32.113" style="s2">Imade, half of Sapele Road will go to</p>
<p begin="00:34:29.613" end="00:34:32.113" style="s2">work hungry.</p>
<p begin="00:34:36.013" end="00:34:40.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They need the wall for the photographs.</p>
<p begin="00:34:38.213" end="00:34:42.514" style="s2">A soup shed spoils the background they</p>
<p begin="00:34:40.214" end="00:34:42.514" style="s2">said.</p>
<p begin="00:34:43.814" end="00:34:48.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then the photographer can stand on the</p>
<p begin="00:34:45.314" end="00:34:48.314" style="s2">other side of the street.</p>
<p begin="00:34:54.414" end="00:34:57.514" style="s2">Two minutes.</p>
<p begin="00:34:55.914" end="00:35:00.114" style="s2">Inside that gate, everybody is talking</p>
<p begin="00:34:57.514" end="00:35:02.114" style="s2">about napkins.</p>
<p begin="00:35:00.114" end="00:35:04.414" style="s2">You know, my mother started exactly like</p>
<p begin="00:35:02.114" end="00:35:09.714" style="s2">this.</p>
<p begin="00:35:04.414" end="00:35:09.714" style="s2">One pot at a junction in this same city.</p>
<p begin="00:35:10.414" end="00:35:13.414" style="s2">She tells me when she wants me to feel</p>
<p begin="00:35:12.014" end="00:35:16.514" style="s2">lazy.</p>
<p begin="00:35:13.414" end="00:35:16.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your mother must be</p>
<p begin="00:35:19.514" end="00:35:23.314" style="s2">She must be a very hard-working woman.</p>
<p begin="00:35:24.214" end="00:35:28.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hard-working and hard.</p>
<p begin="00:35:26.514" end="00:35:30.614" style="s2">She would start correcting your pepper.</p>
<p begin="00:35:28.914" end="00:35:33.814" style="s2">And you are the only person in Benin who</p>
<p begin="00:35:30.614" end="00:35:33.814" style="s2">ever gave me my money back.</p>
<p begin="00:35:34.714" end="00:35:38.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was only 50,000 Kena. You will</p>
<p begin="00:35:36.714" end="00:35:40.114" style="s2">survive it.</p>
<p begin="00:35:38.914" end="00:35:43.514" style="s2">Kena.</p>
<p begin="00:35:40.114" end="00:35:43.514" style="s2">Baby, the programs.</p>
<p begin="00:35:43.614" end="00:35:47.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come in. Keep this bench for me, Madi.</p>
<p begin="00:35:56.214" end="00:35:59.714" style="s2">Sitting with my groom on my father&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:35:57.714" end="00:36:02.614" style="s2">bench. Look at my groom again, and you</p>
<p begin="00:35:59.714" end="00:36:02.614" style="s2">will cook in the gutter.</p>
<p begin="00:36:05.114" end="00:36:09.214" style="s2">And not one word to him about who you</p>
<p begin="00:36:06.914" end="00:36:11.014" style="s2">are. To him, you are the kiosk. Keep it</p>
<p begin="00:36:09.214" end="00:36:13.814" style="s2">that way.</p>
<p begin="00:36:11.014" end="00:36:15.214" style="s2">He sat down by himself, Zara.</p>
<p begin="00:36:13.814" end="00:36:17.814" style="s2">The next time</p>
<p begin="00:36:15.214" end="00:36:17.814" style="s2">you stand up.</p>
<p begin="00:36:39.614" end="00:36:44.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma, your pressure tablets. Swallow them</p>
<p begin="00:36:42.214" end="00:36:46.016" style="s2">now. I dey watch you.</p>
<p begin="00:36:44.014" end="00:36:48.516" style="s2">And I buy meat pie.</p>
<p begin="00:36:46.016" end="00:36:50.716" style="s2">I beg, may they chop meat pie?</p>
<p begin="00:36:48.516" end="00:36:52.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A maid eats whatever falls into her</p>
<p begin="00:36:50.716" end="00:36:55.316" style="s2">hand, Lucky.</p>
<p begin="00:36:52.716" end="00:36:55.316" style="s2">Give it here.</p>
<p begin="00:36:56.116" end="00:37:00.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma, I talk am with respect.</p>
<p begin="00:36:58.516" end="00:37:03.016" style="s2">When the boy finds out, he go say you</p>
<p begin="00:37:00.516" end="00:37:05.716" style="s2">are doing bola again.</p>
<p begin="00:37:03.016" end="00:37:07.616" style="s2">You need more than your word.</p>
<p begin="00:37:05.716" end="00:37:09.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am working on it.</p>
<p begin="00:37:07.616" end="00:37:12.716" style="s2">And I have found a girl who washes beads</p>
<p begin="00:37:09.816" end="00:37:14.716" style="s2">one by one at midnight.</p>
<p begin="00:37:12.716" end="00:37:15.816" style="s2">She looks inside things.</p>
<p begin="00:37:14.716" end="00:37:19.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eheh.</p>
<p begin="00:37:15.816" end="00:37:20.416" style="s2">Now wife material be that, ma.</p>
<p begin="00:37:19.016" end="00:37:22.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Listen to me now.</p>
<p begin="00:37:20.416" end="00:37:25.116" style="s2">Park here tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:37:22.016" end="00:37:27.016" style="s2">All night. Watch that gate.</p>
<p begin="00:37:25.116" end="00:37:29.516" style="s2">If anything happens to her, you call me</p>
<p begin="00:37:27.016" end="00:37:33.216" style="s2">before you breathe.</p>
<p begin="00:37:29.516" end="00:37:33.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All night, ma? My back.</p>
<p begin="00:37:33.816" end="00:37:39.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your back has sat in this car for 20</p>
<p begin="00:37:36.616" end="00:37:42.616" style="s2">years.</p>
<p begin="00:37:39.116" end="00:37:42.616" style="s2">It can sit for one more night.</p>
<p begin="00:37:43.316" end="00:37:47.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rain dey come, ma. Take umbrella. Just</p>
<p begin="00:37:45.516" end="00:37:49.116" style="s2">this one.</p>
<p begin="00:37:47.116" end="00:37:51.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A maid under an umbrella like that one</p>
<p begin="00:37:49.116" end="00:37:53.916" style="s2">gets searched at the gate.</p>
<p begin="00:37:51.216" end="00:37:53.916" style="s2">Keep it dry.</p>
<p begin="00:37:56.216" end="00:38:00.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 40 restaurants.</p>
<p begin="00:37:59.316" end="00:38:03.216" style="s2">And she dey carry pot for somebody</p>
<p begin="00:38:00.916" end="00:38:03.216" style="s2">picking.</p>
<p begin="00:38:07.116" end="00:38:12.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have been quiet since the kiosk, my</p>
<p begin="00:38:08.916" end="00:38:14.116" style="s2">dear. What did she say to you?</p>
<p begin="00:38:12.016" end="00:38:17.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That I will cook in the gutter</p>
<p begin="00:38:14.116" end="00:38:17.016" style="s2">if I look at him.</p>
<p begin="00:38:17.516" end="00:38:21.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It is not new, mama.</p>
<p begin="00:38:19.916" end="00:38:24.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can I tell you something I have never</p>
<p begin="00:38:21.816" end="00:38:25.516" style="s2">said out loud?</p>
<p begin="00:38:24.216" end="00:38:27.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Say it.</p>
<p begin="00:38:25.516" end="00:38:28.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These walls are thin,</p>
<p begin="00:38:27.316" end="00:38:31.116" style="s2">but I am not.</p>
<p begin="00:38:28.916" end="00:38:33.016" style="s2">When my mother died, Papa married again</p>
<p begin="00:38:31.116" end="00:38:35.116" style="s2">in 4 months.</p>
<p begin="00:38:33.016" end="00:38:37.816" style="s2">4 months, mama.</p>
<p begin="00:38:35.116" end="00:38:40.516" style="s2">Harapa was still on the line.</p>
<p begin="00:38:37.816" end="00:38:42.816" style="s2">Since then, in this house,</p>
<p begin="00:38:40.516" end="00:38:44.716" style="s2">I am the one who cooks,</p>
<p begin="00:38:42.816" end="00:38:46.916" style="s2">not the daughter,</p>
<p begin="00:38:44.716" end="00:38:50.817" style="s2">the one who cooks.</p>
<p begin="00:38:46.916" end="00:38:50.817" style="s2">Then come away with me after tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:38:51.217" end="00:38:57.417" style="s2">London, Lagos, any kitchen you choose.</p>
<p begin="00:38:55.717" end="00:39:01.517" style="s2">Nobody there will call you the one who</p>
<p begin="00:38:57.417" end="00:39:01.517" style="s2">cooks. They will call you chef.</p>
<p begin="00:39:02.517" end="00:39:08.317" style="s2">This is my father&#39;s house, mama. My</p>
<p begin="00:39:04.417" end="00:39:08.317" style="s2">mother&#39;s pot is standing at that gate.</p>
<p begin="00:39:10.167" end="00:39:13.517" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:39:11.617" end="00:39:16.017" style="s2">If I leave, they win the war without</p>
<p begin="00:39:13.517" end="00:39:18.717" style="s2">even fighting for it.</p>
<p begin="00:39:16.017" end="00:39:21.217" style="s2">Stubborn, like a woman I once knew at a</p>
<p begin="00:39:18.717" end="00:39:21.217" style="s2">junction.</p>
<p begin="00:39:31.417" end="00:39:35.717" style="s2">Your ring would be safer inside my pot</p>
<p begin="00:39:33.217" end="00:39:37.417" style="s2">than inside that bag, mama.</p>
<p begin="00:39:35.717" end="00:39:41.717" style="s2">Nobody searches a maid&#39;s bag for</p>
<p begin="00:39:37.417" end="00:39:41.717" style="s2">diamonds. Tomorrow I will need both.</p>
<p begin="00:39:54.417" end="00:39:58.517" style="s2">Food</p>
<p begin="00:39:55.617" end="00:39:58.517" style="s2">in a BQ.</p>
<p begin="00:39:58.717" end="00:40:02.817" style="s2">Soft hands, buffed nails, and she says</p>
<p begin="00:40:01.117" end="00:40:04.317" style="s2">yes ma like somebody reading it from a</p>
<p begin="00:40:02.817" end="00:40:08.417" style="s2">paper.</p>
<p begin="00:40:04.317" end="00:40:08.417" style="s2">Let us see what an agency maid carries.</p>
<p begin="00:40:22.517" end="00:40:27.617" style="s2">Which maid carries a stone like this</p>
<p begin="00:40:25.317" end="00:40:27.617" style="s2">one?</p>
<p begin="00:40:28.017" end="00:40:32.017" style="s2">Is this what the agency pays them now?</p>
<p begin="00:40:39.248" end="00:40:41.268" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:40:44.917" end="00:40:50.618" style="s2">That little boy has the groom&#39;s eyes.</p>
<p begin="00:40:48.218" end="00:40:50.618" style="s2">Madu.</p>
<p begin="00:40:59.518" end="00:41:03.618" style="s2">Mommy, I am live in 5 minutes. Whatever</p>
<p begin="00:41:01.818" end="00:41:06.318" style="s2">it Madu.</p>
<p begin="00:41:03.618" end="00:41:09.018" style="s2">Neoma Madu.</p>
<p begin="00:41:06.318" end="00:41:11.218" style="s2">The maid is Kena&#39;s mother.</p>
<p begin="00:41:09.018" end="00:41:13.218" style="s2">The ring was with it. A stone the size</p>
<p begin="00:41:11.218" end="00:41:15.918" style="s2">of a groundnut in a cloth bag behind</p>
<p begin="00:41:13.218" end="00:41:15.918" style="s2">Imade&#39;s door.</p>
<p begin="00:41:16.818" end="00:41:21.218" style="s2">She poured it on purpose. She was</p>
<p begin="00:41:18.518" end="00:41:21.218" style="s2">testing me.</p>
<p begin="00:41:21.318" end="00:41:25.918" style="s2">And I slapped her.</p>
<p begin="00:41:23.518" end="00:41:28.918" style="s2">In front of everybody on my live. And</p>
<p begin="00:41:25.918" end="00:41:28.918" style="s2">you put her in the rain.</p>
<p begin="00:41:30.018" end="00:41:35.518" style="s2">I put a maid in the rain.</p>
<p begin="00:41:32.218" end="00:41:35.518" style="s2">Who told me she was a lady?</p>
<p begin="00:41:39.418" end="00:41:43.318" style="s2">Mommy, listen to me. If she tells him I</p>
<p begin="00:41:41.318" end="00:41:46.018" style="s2">slapped her and locked her outside,</p>
<p begin="00:41:43.318" end="00:41:46.018" style="s2">there is no wedding.</p>
<p begin="00:41:47.018" end="00:41:53.018" style="s2">No wedding, no key. And on Monday at</p>
<p begin="00:41:49.418" end="00:41:53.018" style="s2">noon, that man takes everything.</p>
<p begin="00:42:04.118" end="00:42:07.718" style="s2">So Kena hears it from me first.</p>
<p begin="00:42:06.318" end="00:42:11.218" style="s2">His mother lied to him. She dressed like</p>
<p begin="00:42:07.718" end="00:42:11.218" style="s2">a maid in my house to spy on me.</p>
<p begin="00:42:13.018" end="00:42:16.718" style="s2">And she has been sleeping in BQ with</p>
<p begin="00:42:14.518" end="00:42:20.418" style="s2">that kiosk girl who has been feeding him</p>
<p begin="00:42:16.718" end="00:42:20.418" style="s2">banga every morning for a year.</p>
<p begin="00:42:22.318" end="00:42:26.518" style="s2">He told me himself, Mommy, if his mother</p>
<p begin="00:42:24.718" end="00:42:28.918" style="s2">starts her tests again, he is standing</p>
<p begin="00:42:26.518" end="00:42:28.918" style="s2">with me.</p>
<p begin="00:42:29.518" end="00:42:33.518" style="s2">Put it back exactly where you found it.</p>
<p begin="00:42:31.318" end="00:42:36.518" style="s2">Same knot.</p>
<p begin="00:42:33.518" end="00:42:39.818" style="s2">Baby, come now. Please, I need you.</p>
<p begin="00:42:36.518" end="00:42:39.818" style="s2">Your mother is in my house.</p>
<p begin="00:42:41.718" end="00:42:44.318" style="s2">And Imade?</p>
<p begin="00:42:45.018" end="00:42:47.518" style="s2">Tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:42:47.629" end="00:42:49.649" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:43:00.720" end="00:43:05.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look by the sink.</p>
<p begin="00:43:02.520" end="00:43:07.520" style="s2">I did not want to believe it either.</p>
<p begin="00:43:05.220" end="00:43:07.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy?</p>
<p begin="00:43:14.320" end="00:43:19.120" style="s2">You are in London.</p>
<p begin="00:43:16.420" end="00:43:20.520" style="s2">I spoke to you at lunchtime.</p>
<p begin="00:43:19.120" end="00:43:21.920" style="s2">They were calling your flight behind</p>
<p begin="00:43:20.520" end="00:43:23.120" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:43:21.920" end="00:43:25.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, Kenna.</p>
<p begin="00:43:23.120" end="00:43:27.620" style="s2">I came as a maid yesterday evening</p>
<p begin="00:43:25.320" end="00:43:29.520" style="s2">through an agency. And yes, I poured the</p>
<p begin="00:43:27.620" end="00:43:32.120" style="s2">soup her gown</p>
<p begin="00:43:29.520" end="00:43:34.520" style="s2">on purpose.</p>
<p begin="00:43:32.120" end="00:43:37.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; On purpose? You poured hot soup on my</p>
<p begin="00:43:34.520" end="00:43:39.720" style="s2">bride two days before my wedding</p>
<p begin="00:43:37.020" end="00:43:39.720" style="s2">on purpose.</p>
<p begin="00:43:42.620" end="00:43:48.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I slapped a maid who attacked me, Kenna.</p>
<p begin="00:43:45.420" end="00:43:51.220" style="s2">Any bride would have done the same.</p>
<p begin="00:43:48.520" end="00:43:52.920" style="s2">How could I know who she was?</p>
<p begin="00:43:51.220" end="00:43:56.320" style="s2">And all this time she has been sleeping</p>
<p begin="00:43:52.920" end="00:43:56.320" style="s2">in the BQ with Imade.</p>
<p begin="00:44:00.335" end="00:44:03.020" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:44:01.220" end="00:44:04.720" style="s2">The girl from the kiosk,</p>
<p begin="00:44:03.020" end="00:44:06.720" style="s2">the one who has wanted you for a whole</p>
<p begin="00:44:04.720" end="00:44:08.020" style="s2">year.</p>
<p begin="00:44:06.720" end="00:44:10.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The kiosk girl?</p>
<p begin="00:44:08.020" end="00:44:12.920" style="s2">What is Imade doing in this kitchen?</p>
<p begin="00:44:10.620" end="00:44:15.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She is my stepsister,</p>
<p begin="00:44:12.920" end="00:44:17.320" style="s2">Papa&#39;s daughter from before.</p>
<p begin="00:44:15.020" end="00:44:19.820" style="s2">I hid her from you because I was ashamed</p>
<p begin="00:44:17.320" end="00:44:22.520" style="s2">of how she lives.</p>
<p begin="00:44:19.820" end="00:44:24.520" style="s2">Ashamed of how you made me live.</p>
<p begin="00:44:22.520" end="00:44:28.120" style="s2">Watch your mouth in my kitchen.</p>
<p begin="00:44:24.520" end="00:44:28.120" style="s2">Did anybody ask you to open it?</p>
<p begin="00:44:28.320" end="00:44:33.520" style="s2">And you, Madam London, hiding in my</p>
<p begin="00:44:30.620" end="00:44:36.120" style="s2">compound, sleeping in my BQ, eating my</p>
<p begin="00:44:33.520" end="00:44:38.120" style="s2">rice like a thief.</p>
<p begin="00:44:36.120" end="00:44:39.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I ate your rice, ma,</p>
<p begin="00:44:38.120" end="00:44:42.320" style="s2">and I paid for every grain of it with</p>
<p begin="00:44:39.720" end="00:44:42.320" style="s2">your floors.</p>
<p begin="00:44:47.520" end="00:44:52.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Outside.</p>
<p begin="00:44:49.020" end="00:44:52.220" style="s2">Mommy, now.</p>
<p begin="00:45:00.621" end="00:45:06.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; London, mummy.</p>
<p begin="00:45:02.921" end="00:45:09.121" style="s2">You told me London. I heard the airport.</p>
<p begin="00:45:06.321" end="00:45:11.521" style="s2">British Airways now boarding.</p>
<p begin="00:45:09.121" end="00:45:13.921" style="s2">That was you. Lucky. That was you on the</p>
<p begin="00:45:11.521" end="00:45:15.621" style="s2">other phone.</p>
<p begin="00:45:13.921" end="00:45:18.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, I only hold the phone. The</p>
<p begin="00:45:15.621" end="00:45:20.921" style="s2">announcement now from YouTube.</p>
<p begin="00:45:18.121" end="00:45:22.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You flew in, put on a uniform,</p>
<p begin="00:45:20.921" end="00:45:25.121" style="s2">and walked into my bride&#39;s house to set</p>
<p begin="00:45:22.621" end="00:45:25.121" style="s2">a trap.</p>
<p begin="00:45:25.421" end="00:45:28.921" style="s2">Like Bola.</p>
<p begin="00:45:27.321" end="00:45:30.321" style="s2">You put money on a table in front of</p>
<p begin="00:45:28.921" end="00:45:33.021" style="s2">Bola,</p>
<p begin="00:45:30.321" end="00:45:33.021" style="s2">and I lost her.</p>
<p begin="00:45:33.621" end="00:45:38.321" style="s2">Three years I have told myself it was</p>
<p begin="00:45:35.321" end="00:45:41.321" style="s2">her choice, not your exam.</p>
<p begin="00:45:38.321" end="00:45:41.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kena, my son.</p>
<p begin="00:45:42.021" end="00:45:47.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, let me finish for once. Every woman</p>
<p begin="00:45:44.521" end="00:45:47.921" style="s2">I love has to pass your exam.</p>
<p begin="00:45:48.621" end="00:45:53.121" style="s2">You never asked me if I wanted a wife</p>
<p begin="00:45:50.521" end="00:45:55.321" style="s2">who pass who passes.</p>
<p begin="00:45:53.121" end="00:45:57.221" style="s2">I wanted a wife.</p>
<p begin="00:45:55.321" end="00:45:59.321" style="s2">Somebody who chose me, not somebody you</p>
<p begin="00:45:57.221" end="00:46:01.221" style="s2">approved from behind a door.</p>
<p begin="00:45:59.321" end="00:46:03.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bola took my money.</p>
<p begin="00:46:01.221" end="00:46:06.021" style="s2">This one locked me in the rain.</p>
<p begin="00:46:03.921" end="00:46:07.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And who saw it?</p>
<p begin="00:46:06.021" end="00:46:09.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Six friends</p>
<p begin="00:46:07.421" end="00:46:12.021" style="s2">and a girl in lilac who filmed the whole</p>
<p begin="00:46:09.221" end="00:46:12.021" style="s2">thing live.</p>
<p begin="00:46:12.921" end="00:46:17.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zara says the girl deleted it.</p>
<p begin="00:46:15.321" end="00:46:19.921" style="s2">The six friends say you attacked her.</p>
<p begin="00:46:17.421" end="00:46:23.321" style="s2">So it is your word, mummy.</p>
<p begin="00:46:19.921" end="00:46:23.321" style="s2">Your word against my whole wedding.</p>
<p begin="00:46:26.121" end="00:46:29.721" style="s2">Go to the hotel.</p>
<p begin="00:46:27.521" end="00:46:30.921" style="s2">If you come to my wedding tomorrow,</p>
<p begin="00:46:29.721" end="00:46:33.521" style="s2">you lose me.</p>
<p begin="00:46:30.921" end="00:46:33.521" style="s2">I mean it.</p>
<p begin="00:46:36.621" end="00:46:40.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The agency give me these keys since</p>
<p begin="00:46:38.321" end="00:46:42.221" style="s2">Thursday, ma.</p>
<p begin="00:46:40.221" end="00:46:44.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kema, they come with me. Pack your bag</p>
<p begin="00:46:42.221" end="00:46:46.921" style="s2">tonight before they decide for you.</p>
<p begin="00:46:44.721" end="00:46:49.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go, mama. I am staying with my mother&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:46:46.921" end="00:46:49.321" style="s2">pot.</p>
<p begin="00:46:53.621" end="00:46:56.321" style="s2">10 o&#39;clock.</p>
<p begin="00:47:06.523" end="00:47:10.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His mother is gone. 10:00 tomorrow I am</p>
<p begin="00:47:09.223" end="00:47:13.323" style="s2">his wife.</p>
<p begin="00:47:10.823" end="00:47:13.323" style="s2">Send.</p>
<p begin="00:47:15.422" end="00:47:21.122" style="s2">Pull your stomach in. And the girl? She</p>
<p begin="00:47:18.422" end="00:47:24.323" style="s2">heard things in that BQ.</p>
<p begin="00:47:21.122" end="00:47:26.023" style="s2">That woman talked to her every night.</p>
<p begin="00:47:24.323" end="00:47:27.723" style="s2">Kena leaves for the airport at 8:00 to</p>
<p begin="00:47:26.023" end="00:47:30.823" style="s2">bring his uncles from Lagos. Their</p>
<p begin="00:47:27.723" end="00:47:30.823" style="s2">flight lands at 9:00.</p>
<p begin="00:47:33.323" end="00:47:37.323" style="s2">By the time he comes back, that girl</p>
<p begin="00:47:35.323" end="00:47:41.323" style="s2">will be the one who ruined my gown and</p>
<p begin="00:47:37.323" end="00:47:41.323" style="s2">smuggled a liar into my father&#39;s house.</p>
<p begin="00:47:42.323" end="00:47:45.422" style="s2">And she will be outside that gate with</p>
<p begin="00:47:44.023" end="00:47:48.023" style="s2">her pot.</p>
<p begin="00:47:45.422" end="00:47:48.023" style="s2">Your father.</p>
<p begin="00:47:51.023" end="00:47:56.723" style="s2">Your husband will do what you tell him</p>
<p begin="00:47:52.723" end="00:47:56.723" style="s2">in front of 150 people.</p>
<p begin="00:48:00.922" end="00:48:05.308" style="s2">And the girl in lilac? What if that</p>
<p begin="00:48:02.823" end="00:48:07.328" style="s2">video is still sitting inside her phone?</p>
<p begin="00:48:05.308" end="00:48:07.328" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:48:08.523" end="00:48:11.922" style="s2">She deletes what I tell her to delete,</p>
<p begin="00:48:10.122" end="00:48:15.323" style="s2">mummy. She has been eating out of my</p>
<p begin="00:48:11.922" end="00:48:15.323" style="s2">hand since secondary school.</p>
<p begin="00:48:16.823" end="00:48:21.323" style="s2">Smile, mummy. Tonight our guests get a</p>
<p begin="00:48:18.922" end="00:48:21.323" style="s2">show.</p>
<p begin="00:48:30.922" end="00:48:34.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 1 2 Benin, are we ready?</p>
<p begin="00:48:33.723" end="00:48:36.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ready.</p>
<p begin="00:48:34.223" end="00:48:38.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ah, no be like that.</p>
<p begin="00:48:36.723" end="00:48:40.723" style="s2">I say Benin, are we ready?</p>
<p begin="00:48:38.622" end="00:48:42.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ready.</p>
<p begin="00:48:40.723" end="00:48:45.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who park white Range Rover for front of</p>
<p begin="00:48:42.523" end="00:48:47.883" style="s2">the gate? Oga, shift and small. This one</p>
<p begin="00:48:45.223" end="00:48:49.823" style="s2">na send forth, no be motor park.</p>
<p begin="00:48:47.883" end="00:48:51.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [applause]</p>
<p begin="00:48:49.823" end="00:48:54.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That one is mine. It stays where</p>
<p begin="00:48:51.823" end="00:48:54.922" style="s2">everybody can see it.</p>
<p begin="00:48:59.723" end="00:49:05.724" style="s2">Kena, please, 2 minutes. About the gown</p>
<p begin="00:49:02.424" end="00:49:06.924" style="s2">and about your mother before tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:49:05.724" end="00:49:08.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; About my mother?</p>
<p begin="00:49:06.924" end="00:49:11.724" style="s2">Everybody in this house knew something</p>
<p begin="00:49:08.524" end="00:49:11.724" style="s2">about my mother except me.</p>
<p begin="00:49:13.224" end="00:49:18.724" style="s2">You served me soup for a year and never</p>
<p begin="00:49:15.824" end="00:49:18.724" style="s2">told me who you were.</p>
<p begin="00:49:20.724" end="00:49:26.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Would you have let me?</p>
<p begin="00:49:23.524" end="00:49:28.024" style="s2">You saw a kiosk, Kena.</p>
<p begin="00:49:26.324" end="00:49:30.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You never once looked at the gate behind</p>
<p begin="00:49:28.024" end="00:49:30.224" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:49:32.024" end="00:49:36.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Baby, there you are. Go and bring your</p>
<p begin="00:49:33.724" end="00:49:37.824" style="s2">uncles. Their flight lands at 9:00 and</p>
<p begin="00:49:36.224" end="00:49:40.324" style="s2">you know they hate waiting at that small</p>
<p begin="00:49:37.824" end="00:49:42.024" style="s2">airport.</p>
<p begin="00:49:40.324" end="00:49:45.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will be back before 11:00. Keep me</p>
<p begin="00:49:42.024" end="00:49:45.224" style="s2">some jollof, not soup.</p>
<p begin="00:49:49.724" end="00:49:54.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serve my guests. It is the last thing</p>
<p begin="00:49:51.624" end="00:49:54.724" style="s2">you will cook in this house.</p>
<p begin="00:49:56.024" end="00:49:59.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Make some noise for our bride.</p>
<p begin="00:50:10.224" end="00:50:14.924" style="s2">Benin I beg, settle down small. Our</p>
<p begin="00:50:12.124" end="00:50:14.924" style="s2">bride won&#39;t talk.</p>
<p begin="00:50:14.999" end="00:50:17.019" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [applause]</p>
<p begin="00:50:19.124" end="00:50:24.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, my people.</p>
<p begin="00:50:20.924" end="00:50:24.124" style="s2">Before we dance tonight,</p>
<p begin="00:50:25.324" end="00:50:30.624" style="s2">because tomorrow I want to stand at that</p>
<p begin="00:50:27.224" end="00:50:30.624" style="s2">altar with a clean heart.</p>
<p begin="00:50:31.724" end="00:50:36.924" style="s2">Last night my wedding gown was ruined.</p>
<p begin="00:50:34.224" end="00:50:40.824" style="s2">Hot soup poured down the front by a maid</p>
<p begin="00:50:36.924" end="00:50:40.824" style="s2">this girl smuggled into my father&#39;s BQ.</p>
<p begin="00:50:45.124" end="00:50:48.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Which girl? The one serving the soup?</p>
<p begin="00:50:50.624" end="00:50:54.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, that one. The soup girl at our</p>
<p begin="00:50:52.424" end="00:50:54.824" style="s2">gate.</p>
<p begin="00:50:55.824" end="00:51:01.024" style="s2">My people, she has been feeding my groom</p>
<p begin="00:50:57.824" end="00:51:04.125" style="s2">at that kiosk every morning for a year,</p>
<p begin="00:51:01.024" end="00:51:06.925" style="s2">smiling at him, waiting.</p>
<p begin="00:51:04.125" end="00:51:09.025" style="s2">She wants my groom. And when smiling did</p>
<p begin="00:51:06.925" end="00:51:10.675" style="s2">not work, she brought an old woman into</p>
<p begin="00:51:09.025" end="00:51:12.695" style="s2">our house to spoil my day.</p>
<p begin="00:51:10.675" end="00:51:12.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:51:13.125" end="00:51:17.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That is not true, Zara.</p>
<p begin="00:51:15.025" end="00:51:19.625" style="s2">He paid 2,000 for a plate like every</p>
<p begin="00:51:17.625" end="00:51:22.425" style="s2">Okada man at that gate.</p>
<p begin="00:51:19.625" end="00:51:23.425" style="s2">And he went to work.</p>
<p begin="00:51:22.425" end="00:51:26.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chai.</p>
<p begin="00:51:23.425" end="00:51:29.425" style="s2">Every morning for one year.</p>
<p begin="00:51:26.125" end="00:51:29.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Babe, show them.</p>
<p begin="00:51:35.125" end="00:51:39.825" style="s2">Soup grandma, say hi to my followers.</p>
<p begin="00:51:40.805" end="00:51:42.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:51:51.625" end="00:51:55.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now you have seen it with your own eyes.</p>
<p begin="00:51:56.325" end="00:52:02.425" style="s2">We kept her in this compound out of</p>
<p begin="00:51:58.225" end="00:52:02.425" style="s2">pity, and this is how she pays us back.</p>
<p begin="00:52:03.725" end="00:52:08.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I washed your gown, Zara.</p>
<p begin="00:52:06.225" end="00:52:10.725" style="s2">I washed every bead with my own hands</p>
<p begin="00:52:08.725" end="00:52:12.525" style="s2">all night so that you could wear it</p>
<p begin="00:52:10.725" end="00:52:15.521" style="s2">tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:52:12.525" end="00:52:17.541" style="s2">You washed the evidence.</p>
<p begin="00:52:15.521" end="00:52:17.541" style="s2">[applause]</p>
<p begin="00:52:20.106" end="00:52:22.126" style="s2">[bell]</p>
<p begin="00:52:24.225" end="00:52:28.925" style="s2">Papa,</p>
<p begin="00:52:25.425" end="00:52:28.925" style="s2">tell her where she sleeps tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:52:40.925" end="00:52:45.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop. Please stop it. My mother built</p>
<p begin="00:52:43.925" end="00:52:48.225" style="s2">this with her own money and HER OWN</p>
<p begin="00:52:45.725" end="00:52:48.225" style="s2">HANDS.</p>
<p begin="00:52:51.325" end="00:52:58.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MADAM, PAY US, SISTER.</p>
<p begin="00:52:54.525" end="00:52:58.325" style="s2">SHIFT. MAKE the wood no fall on you.</p>
<p begin="00:53:01.125" end="00:53:05.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Half of these guests ate from that pot</p>
<p begin="00:53:02.925" end="00:53:08.527" style="s2">this morning. Ask them. Sir, you, in the</p>
<p begin="00:53:05.227" end="00:53:08.527" style="s2">blue cap, you had two plates.</p>
<p begin="00:53:10.927" end="00:53:15.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sister, it is not my business. I beg,</p>
<p begin="00:53:13.227" end="00:53:17.827" style="s2">leave me out of it.</p>
<p begin="00:53:15.127" end="00:53:21.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that not a Sohe&#39;s pot? That woman fed</p>
<p begin="00:53:17.827" end="00:53:21.327" style="s2">this whole street for years.</p>
<p begin="00:53:34.927" end="00:53:40.527" style="s2">Papa, tell them to stop.</p>
<p begin="00:53:36.827" end="00:53:40.527" style="s2">You ate from this pot this morning.</p>
<p begin="00:53:51.127" end="00:53:55.527" style="s2">Take your things. Since you love the</p>
<p begin="00:53:52.827" end="00:53:57.727" style="s2">street so much, the street is yours.</p>
<p begin="00:53:55.527" end="00:54:01.227" style="s2">I told you after Saturday.</p>
<p begin="00:53:57.727" end="00:54:01.227" style="s2">I am only one day early.</p>
<p begin="00:54:01.327" end="00:54:07.127" style="s2">Papa, my mother told you hungry people</p>
<p begin="00:54:03.827" end="00:54:07.127" style="s2">do not use the back door.</p>
<p begin="00:54:11.427" end="00:54:15.427" style="s2">Tonight you are putting your own</p>
<p begin="00:54:12.827" end="00:54:16.927" style="s2">daughter out of the front one.</p>
<p begin="00:54:15.427" end="00:54:18.427" style="s2">Look at me.</p>
<p begin="00:54:16.927" end="00:54:21.027" style="s2">Not at her.</p>
<p begin="00:54:18.427" end="00:54:24.727" style="s2">At me.</p>
<p begin="00:54:21.027" end="00:54:24.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Imade, go for now.</p>
<p begin="00:54:34.727" end="00:54:38.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have the gown, the groom and Dara.</p>
<p begin="00:54:37.027" end="00:54:41.027" style="s2">What did my mother&#39;s pot ever take from</p>
<p begin="00:54:38.827" end="00:54:42.627" style="s2">you?</p>
<p begin="00:54:41.027" end="00:54:45.027" style="s2">Let the rain teach her how to carry</p>
<p begin="00:54:42.627" end="00:54:45.027" style="s2">soup.</p>
<p begin="00:55:04.227" end="00:55:07.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mana ha, I don&#39;t dey watch since the</p>
<p begin="00:55:05.827" end="00:55:11.328" style="s2">first crowbar. I call you before I</p>
<p begin="00:55:07.928" end="00:55:11.328" style="s2">breathe, like you talk.</p>
<p begin="00:55:14.428" end="00:55:18.728" style="s2">Ma, the umbrella, I beg today take am.</p>
<p begin="00:55:24.228" end="00:55:27.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama.</p>
<p begin="00:55:25.828" end="00:55:30.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So this is what you look like when you</p>
<p begin="00:55:27.328" end="00:55:30.328" style="s2">are not carrying soup.</p>
<p begin="00:55:31.528" end="00:55:35.128" style="s2">Get up my dear.</p>
<p begin="00:55:33.128" end="00:55:38.728" style="s2">Your mother was right.</p>
<p begin="00:55:35.128" end="00:55:40.928" style="s2">Rain shows you who is family.</p>
<p begin="00:55:38.728" end="00:55:40.928" style="s2">Come.</p>
<p begin="00:55:41.328" end="00:55:44.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kena told you to go Mama.</p>
<p begin="00:55:43.328" end="00:55:47.328" style="s2">He said if you come to his wedding you</p>
<p begin="00:55:44.828" end="00:55:47.328" style="s2">lose him.</p>
<p begin="00:55:50.428" end="00:55:53.228" style="s2">He told me to stay away from his</p>
<p begin="00:55:51.928" end="00:55:57.028" style="s2">wedding.</p>
<p begin="00:55:53.228" end="00:55:57.028" style="s2">Nobody told me to leave you on the road.</p>
<p begin="00:55:59.728" end="00:56:03.828" style="s2">They broke it Mama.</p>
<p begin="00:56:01.728" end="00:56:06.228" style="s2">Four years I kept it standing and they</p>
<p begin="00:56:03.828" end="00:56:09.228" style="s2">broke it in four minutes.</p>
<p begin="00:56:06.228" end="00:56:11.728" style="s2">And Papa watched.</p>
<p begin="00:56:09.228" end="00:56:14.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; On Thursday night you opened a door to a</p>
<p begin="00:56:11.728" end="00:56:17.828" style="s2">stranger with soup in her hair.</p>
<p begin="00:56:14.628" end="00:56:20.428" style="s2">And they punished you for it.</p>
<p begin="00:56:17.828" end="00:56:23.528" style="s2">Tonight the door is mine to open.</p>
<p begin="00:56:20.428" end="00:56:26.928" style="s2">Then we carry what is left.</p>
<p begin="00:56:23.528" end="00:56:26.928" style="s2">Lucky, the pot.</p>
<p begin="00:56:27.428" end="00:56:33.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma, this pot</p>
<p begin="00:56:29.728" end="00:56:33.128" style="s2">he heavy pass my whole life.</p>
<p begin="00:56:35.128" end="00:56:38.128" style="s2">Okay okay I don&#39;t carry am.</p>
<p begin="00:56:58.028" end="00:57:01.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lucky, put the heater on.</p>
<p begin="00:57:11.528" end="00:57:16.929" style="s2">The number inside the gown.</p>
<p begin="00:57:14.529" end="00:57:16.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The label?</p>
<p begin="00:57:17.329" end="00:57:23.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She told the whole internet that Kena</p>
<p begin="00:57:19.029" end="00:57:23.229" style="s2">paid 15 million. She told Kena.</p>
<p begin="00:57:23.629" end="00:57:26.929" style="s2">But the label says higher.</p>
<p begin="00:57:27.129" end="00:57:31.929" style="s2">Higher, number 219, return Monday.</p>
<p begin="00:57:32.129" end="00:57:36.429" style="s2">Nobody hires a gown that costs 15</p>
<p begin="00:57:34.329" end="00:57:38.829" style="s2">million naira.</p>
<p begin="00:57:36.429" end="00:57:42.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And the higher goes back on Monday.</p>
<p begin="00:57:38.829" end="00:57:42.729" style="s2">The same Monday as the 60 million.</p>
<p begin="00:57:47.129" end="00:57:50.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So where did his 15 million go?</p>
<p begin="00:57:57.529" end="00:58:02.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Into the hands of the man she must pay</p>
<p begin="00:57:59.729" end="00:58:02.329" style="s2">on Monday.</p>
<p begin="00:58:07.029" end="00:58:10.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma, make I turn for the hotel</p>
<p begin="00:58:08.929" end="00:58:13.029" style="s2">or I go dey circle Benin till una finish</p>
<p begin="00:58:10.929" end="00:58:16.029" style="s2">thinking?</p>
<p begin="00:58:13.029" end="00:58:16.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The hotel, Lucky.</p>
<p begin="00:58:17.229" end="00:58:22.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:58:18.329" end="00:58:22.129" style="s2">And tomorrow I am going to the wedding.</p>
<p begin="00:58:32.529" end="00:58:38.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He said if I come tomorrow, I lose him.</p>
<p begin="00:58:35.729" end="00:58:41.529" style="s2">My only son, Imade.</p>
<p begin="00:58:38.329" end="00:58:44.729" style="s2">And he meant it. I saw his face.</p>
<p begin="00:58:41.529" end="00:58:46.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He told you mama, he did not tell me.</p>
<p begin="00:58:44.729" end="00:58:48.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want to walk into that ballroom</p>
<p begin="00:58:46.329" end="00:58:48.729" style="s2">alone?</p>
<p begin="00:58:50.729" end="00:58:55.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not alone.</p>
<p begin="00:58:52.629" end="00:58:55.129" style="s2">First.</p>
<p begin="00:58:55.229" end="00:58:59.829" style="s2">She called me soup girl in front of 150</p>
<p begin="00:58:58.029" end="00:59:01.829" style="s2">people tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:58:59.829" end="00:59:03.629" style="s2">Tomorrow I will answer her in front of</p>
<p begin="00:59:01.829" end="00:59:05.129" style="s2">300</p>
<p begin="00:59:03.629" end="00:59:07.529" style="s2">myself.</p>
<p begin="00:59:05.129" end="00:59:08.929" style="s2">Not with your mouth, mama.</p>
<p begin="00:59:07.529" end="00:59:10.729" style="s2">With mine.</p>
<p begin="00:59:08.929" end="00:59:12.429" style="s2">Then tell me how.</p>
<p begin="00:59:10.729" end="00:59:14.731" style="s2">Slowly.</p>
<p begin="00:59:12.429" end="00:59:17.031" style="s2">I am an old woman.</p>
<p begin="00:59:14.731" end="00:59:19.031" style="s2">The gown first. She will be wearing it,</p>
<p begin="00:59:17.031" end="00:59:21.631" style="s2">so the proof walks into that hall on her</p>
<p begin="00:59:19.031" end="00:59:21.631" style="s2">own back.</p>
<p begin="00:59:22.331" end="00:59:26.931" style="s2">I turn the lining out and I read the</p>
<p begin="00:59:24.131" end="00:59:26.931" style="s2">label to him.</p>
<p begin="00:59:27.831" end="00:59:34.431" style="s2">Then her own words from the balcony, the</p>
<p begin="00:59:30.131" end="00:59:34.431" style="s2">ones about the key, back to her face.</p>
<p begin="00:59:37.131" end="00:59:41.731" style="s2">And then we see who in that hall is</p>
<p begin="00:59:38.831" end="00:59:41.731" style="s2">waiting for Monday.</p>
<p begin="00:59:43.431" end="00:59:48.731" style="s2">Imade, listen to me.</p>
<p begin="00:59:46.131" end="00:59:52.231" style="s2">I came here to test one bride</p>
<p begin="00:59:48.731" end="00:59:52.231" style="s2">and the bill came to your door.</p>
<p begin="00:59:52.331" end="00:59:56.931" style="s2">Your tin, your bed, your mother&#39;s pot.</p>
<p begin="00:59:59.231" end="01:00:03.531" style="s2">I am sorry.</p>
<p begin="01:00:01.431" end="01:00:04.731" style="s2">Not the way a maid says sorry to her</p>
<p begin="01:00:03.531" end="01:00:06.931" style="s2">madam,</p>
<p begin="01:00:04.731" end="01:00:09.731" style="s2">the way a mother says it when she should</p>
<p begin="01:00:06.931" end="01:00:09.731" style="s2">have known better.</p>
<p begin="01:00:10.431" end="01:00:16.131" style="s2">Tomorrow, stand behind me, not in front.</p>
<p begin="01:00:14.031" end="01:00:18.831" style="s2">Behind you. I have not stood behind</p>
<p begin="01:00:16.131" end="01:00:20.331" style="s2">anybody since I left that junction.</p>
<p begin="01:00:18.831" end="01:00:22.631" style="s2">Then tomorrow will be good practice,</p>
<p begin="01:00:20.331" end="01:00:22.631" style="s2">mama.</p>
<p begin="01:00:22.846" end="01:00:24.866" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:00:26.776" end="01:00:31.231" style="s2">[bell] The white house on Ihama Road.</p>
<p begin="01:00:29.431" end="01:00:33.831" style="s2">I promised it to my son&#39;s wife on her</p>
<p begin="01:00:31.231" end="01:00:37.931" style="s2">wedding morning.</p>
<p begin="01:00:33.831" end="01:00:37.931" style="s2">Tomorrow, this box gives my answer.</p>
<p begin="01:00:42.731" end="01:00:48.131" style="s2">Bellrose Bridal, good morning, ma. I am</p>
<p begin="01:00:45.131" end="01:00:48.131" style="s2">calling about a hire.</p>
<p begin="01:00:51.531" end="01:00:55.531" style="s2">219.</p>
<p begin="01:00:53.131" end="01:00:58.531" style="s2">The ivory beaded mermaid hired to Miss</p>
<p begin="01:00:55.531" end="01:01:00.231" style="s2">Zara Osagi for 700,000 naira to come</p>
<p begin="01:00:58.531" end="01:01:01.931" style="s2">back clean on Monday.</p>
<p begin="01:01:00.231" end="01:01:03.831" style="s2">Who is asking, please?</p>
<p begin="01:01:01.931" end="01:01:05.431" style="s2">The person who washed the soup out of</p>
<p begin="01:01:03.831" end="01:01:07.031" style="s2">it, ma.</p>
<p begin="01:01:05.431" end="01:01:10.031" style="s2">Bead by bead,</p>
<p begin="01:01:07.031" end="01:01:10.031" style="s2">bead by bead.</p>
<p begin="01:01:10.131" end="01:01:16.531" style="s2">Come to the hotel in GRA at 10 to the</p>
<p begin="01:01:12.531" end="01:01:16.531" style="s2">Osagi wedding, to the Osagi wedding.</p>
<p begin="01:01:16.731" end="01:01:20.332" style="s2">You want to collect your gown early.</p>
<p begin="01:01:22.732" end="01:01:26.332" style="s2">10 o&#39;clock I will be there.</p>
<p begin="01:01:28.032" end="01:01:33.432" style="s2">The dress I ordered for you is still in</p>
<p begin="01:01:29.732" end="01:01:36.432" style="s2">its box. It came from Lagos at midnight.</p>
<p begin="01:01:33.432" end="01:01:38.332" style="s2">At midnight with a man and a van.</p>
<p begin="01:01:36.432" end="01:01:39.832" style="s2">My mother sewed this one.</p>
<p begin="01:01:38.332" end="01:01:43.732" style="s2">It was at the bottom of the bag they</p>
<p begin="01:01:39.832" end="01:01:46.732" style="s2">threw into the street wrapped in nylon.</p>
<p begin="01:01:43.732" end="01:01:49.832" style="s2">It came through the rain.</p>
<p begin="01:01:46.732" end="01:01:49.832" style="s2">Today she comes with me.</p>
<p begin="01:01:52.432" end="01:01:56.632" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma, the car is ready.</p>
<p begin="01:01:54.932" end="01:01:58.732" style="s2">And the umbrella is ready.</p>
<p begin="01:01:56.632" end="01:02:01.632" style="s2">Today you go take am?</p>
<p begin="01:01:58.732" end="01:02:03.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Today Lucky it is raining on somebody</p>
<p begin="01:02:01.632" end="01:02:03.932" style="s2">else.</p>
<p begin="01:02:16.232" end="01:02:21.132" style="s2">He is already downstairs. Good, sit and</p>
<p begin="01:02:18.732" end="01:02:21.132" style="s2">watch.</p>
<p begin="01:02:22.132" end="01:02:26.932" style="s2">Thursday&#39;s life, the slap.</p>
<p begin="01:02:24.132" end="01:02:26.932" style="s2">You deleted it?</p>
<p begin="01:02:27.232" end="01:02:32.232" style="s2">Yes, babe. It is gone.</p>
<p begin="01:02:30.132" end="01:02:34.832" style="s2">Good. Today nobody in Benin remembers</p>
<p begin="01:02:32.232" end="01:02:37.232" style="s2">Thursday. Today they remember the gown.</p>
<p begin="01:02:34.832" end="01:02:39.132" style="s2">And you film only my good side. Nothing</p>
<p begin="01:02:37.232" end="01:02:41.932" style="s2">else goes online.</p>
<p begin="01:02:39.132" end="01:02:45.432" style="s2">Only your good side, babe. I promise.</p>
<p begin="01:02:41.932" end="01:02:48.332" style="s2">Stand still, my daughter. Smile.</p>
<p begin="01:02:45.432" end="01:02:50.832" style="s2">Your face must carry this whole day.</p>
<p begin="01:02:48.332" end="01:02:54.808" style="s2">By noon the keys in your hand and by</p>
<p begin="01:02:50.832" end="01:02:55.832" style="s2">Monday that man is out of our lives.</p>
<p begin="01:02:54.808" end="01:02:59.032" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:02:55.832" end="01:03:00.232" style="s2">Mommy, I am smiling. Look at me. Bride</p>
<p begin="01:02:59.032" end="01:03:02.832" style="s2">of the year.</p>
<p begin="01:03:00.232" end="01:03:05.632" style="s2">And the girl?</p>
<p begin="01:03:02.832" end="01:03:08.832" style="s2">If she comes near this hotel</p>
<p begin="01:03:05.632" end="01:03:11.832" style="s2">she is sitting in a gutter with her pot</p>
<p begin="01:03:08.832" end="01:03:11.832" style="s2">where she belongs.</p>
<p begin="01:03:36.073" end="01:03:38.093" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:03:40.833" end="01:03:45.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kena, where is your mother?</p>
<p begin="01:03:43.333" end="01:03:46.933" style="s2">Since we landed last night, nobody has</p>
<p begin="01:03:45.233" end="01:03:48.633" style="s2">seen her.</p>
<p begin="01:03:46.933" end="01:03:51.833" style="s2">Your mother would not miss your wedding</p>
<p begin="01:03:48.633" end="01:03:54.933" style="s2">for all the restaurants in London.</p>
<p begin="01:03:51.833" end="01:03:54.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She is in London, uncle.</p>
<p begin="01:03:56.033" end="01:04:00.033" style="s2">&gt;&gt; London? She told me herself she would</p>
<p begin="01:03:58.333" end="01:04:01.533" style="s2">land this morning and dance me off my</p>
<p begin="01:04:00.033" end="01:04:03.633" style="s2">feet.</p>
<p begin="01:04:01.533" end="01:04:06.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Things changed, uncle.</p>
<p begin="01:04:03.633" end="01:04:08.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Changed? Kena, a mother does not change</p>
<p begin="01:04:06.433" end="01:04:10.533" style="s2">like the weather.</p>
<p begin="01:04:08.533" end="01:04:12.733" style="s2">Did you two quarrel?</p>
<p begin="01:04:10.533" end="01:04:14.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uncle, today is my wedding. Tomorrow you</p>
<p begin="01:04:12.733" end="01:04:15.933" style="s2">can ask me anything you like. Please,</p>
<p begin="01:04:14.833" end="01:04:18.833" style="s2">let&#39;s go in.</p>
<p begin="01:04:15.933" end="01:04:18.833" style="s2">The pastor is waiting.</p>
<p begin="01:04:21.733" end="01:04:24.733" style="s2">Row three, sir. Groom side or bride</p>
<p begin="01:04:23.733" end="01:04:26.633" style="s2">side?</p>
<p begin="01:04:24.733" end="01:04:29.033" style="s2">The bride&#39;s. I have invested a great</p>
<p begin="01:04:26.633" end="01:04:30.933" style="s2">deal in her.</p>
<p begin="01:04:29.033" end="01:04:34.033" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Osagie, lift your head. People are</p>
<p begin="01:04:30.933" end="01:04:35.833" style="s2">looking. Last night is finished.</p>
<p begin="01:04:34.033" end="01:04:39.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It is your daughter&#39;s wedding.</p>
<p begin="01:04:35.833" end="01:04:39.633" style="s2">Yes, my daughter&#39;s. Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:04:43.539" end="01:04:45.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [applause]</p>
<p begin="01:04:49.433" end="01:04:55.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; By noon.</p>
<p begin="01:04:51.933" end="01:04:55.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; By noon, Mrs. Madu.</p>
<p begin="01:05:02.535" end="01:05:04.555" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:05:09.085" end="01:05:11.105" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:05:11.533" end="01:05:14.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dearly beloved,</p>
<p begin="01:05:12.933" end="01:05:16.833" style="s2">we are gathered here before God and</p>
<p begin="01:05:14.633" end="01:05:19.233" style="s2">these witnesses</p>
<p begin="01:05:16.833" end="01:05:20.833" style="s2">to join this man and this woman in holy</p>
<p begin="01:05:19.233" end="01:05:22.535" style="s2">matrimony.</p>
<p begin="01:05:20.833" end="01:05:25.135" style="s2">Who brings this woman to be married to</p>
<p begin="01:05:22.535" end="01:05:25.135" style="s2">this man?</p>
<p begin="01:05:25.335" end="01:05:28.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I, her mother and I.</p>
<p begin="01:05:29.735" end="01:05:32.635" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We do, pastor.</p>
<p begin="01:05:49.435" end="01:05:53.235" style="s2">Is that not the woman from Nneoma&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:05:50.935" end="01:05:55.035" style="s2">table? The London one? I saw her in a</p>
<p begin="01:05:53.235" end="01:05:56.335" style="s2">magazine.</p>
<p begin="01:05:55.035" end="01:05:59.435" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It is her.</p>
<p begin="01:05:56.335" end="01:05:59.435" style="s2">Lady Nneoma Madu.</p>
<p begin="01:05:59.635" end="01:06:02.535" style="s2">The groom&#39;s mother.</p>
<p begin="01:06:05.235" end="01:06:08.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Soup grandma.</p>
<p begin="01:06:13.275" end="01:06:17.135" style="s2">[music] Kena, Kena, do something. Tell</p>
<p begin="01:06:15.335" end="01:06:18.735" style="s2">her to go.</p>
<p begin="01:06:17.135" end="01:06:21.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, I told you.</p>
<p begin="01:06:18.735" end="01:06:23.535" style="s2">I told you not to come.</p>
<p begin="01:06:21.735" end="01:06:26.235" style="s2">Madam, please. We are in the middle of</p>
<p begin="01:06:23.535" end="01:06:26.235" style="s2">the vows.</p>
<p begin="01:06:27.235" end="01:06:31.635" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know, pastor. Forgive me.</p>
<p begin="01:06:29.735" end="01:06:33.435" style="s2">This will not take long.</p>
<p begin="01:06:31.635" end="01:06:36.635" style="s2">After it, you may decide if there are</p>
<p begin="01:06:33.435" end="01:06:36.635" style="s2">still vows to say.</p>
<p begin="01:06:38.935" end="01:06:44.935" style="s2">Two nights ago, I asked this bride a</p>
<p begin="01:06:40.935" end="01:06:47.335" style="s2">question with a bowl of soup.</p>
<p begin="01:06:44.935" end="01:06:47.335" style="s2">Today</p>
<p begin="01:07:01.091" end="01:07:03.111" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:07:06.135" end="01:07:10.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everybody listen to me. This woman</p>
<p begin="01:07:08.135" end="01:07:12.935" style="s2">dressed herself as a maid, poured hot</p>
<p begin="01:07:10.335" end="01:07:14.835" style="s2">soup on my gown on Thursday night,</p>
<p begin="01:07:12.935" end="01:07:18.235" style="s2">and slept in my father&#39;s BQ with that</p>
<p begin="01:07:14.835" end="01:07:18.235" style="s2">girl to destroy my wedding.</p>
<p begin="01:07:22.935" end="01:07:28.336" style="s2">Ask him. Ask my groom what did to the</p>
<p begin="01:07:25.236" end="01:07:28.336" style="s2">last girl he loved.</p>
<p begin="01:07:29.336" end="01:07:35.736" style="s2">Security. Security. What are you PEOPLE</p>
<p begin="01:07:32.136" end="01:07:37.771" style="s2">WAITING FOR? CARRY these two outside.</p>
<p begin="01:07:35.736" end="01:07:39.236" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told you under that balcony yesterday.</p>
<p begin="01:07:37.771" end="01:07:41.736" style="s2">[music] If you come to my wedding, you</p>
<p begin="01:07:39.236" end="01:07:41.736" style="s2">lose me.</p>
<p begin="01:07:43.036" end="01:07:47.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I did not come to speak, Kena. She did.</p>
<p begin="01:07:52.536" end="01:07:56.236" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that not the girl they threw out at</p>
<p begin="01:07:54.136" end="01:07:59.536" style="s2">the send forth last night?</p>
<p begin="01:07:56.236" end="01:07:59.536" style="s2">The one with the soup pot.</p>
<p begin="01:08:00.696" end="01:08:02.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:08:02.006" end="01:08:05.336" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:08:02.336" end="01:08:07.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The soup girl in my wedding wearing a</p>
<p begin="01:08:05.336" end="01:08:10.736" style="s2">gown her dead mother sewed. Somebody</p>
<p begin="01:08:07.936" end="01:08:14.436" style="s2">take a picture. This one is history.</p>
<p begin="01:08:10.736" end="01:08:16.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. The soup girl who washed your gown.</p>
<p begin="01:08:14.436" end="01:08:19.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Imade, not here.</p>
<p begin="01:08:16.536" end="01:08:21.136" style="s2">Not today, please.</p>
<p begin="01:08:19.536" end="01:08:23.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Last night you drove away before I could</p>
<p begin="01:08:21.136" end="01:08:26.136" style="s2">finish one sentence, Kena.</p>
<p begin="01:08:23.336" end="01:08:29.336" style="s2">Today you will hear all of it.</p>
<p begin="01:08:26.136" end="01:08:29.336" style="s2">Zara, turn around.</p>
<p begin="01:08:38.436" end="01:08:42.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t touch me. She is tearing my gown.</p>
<p begin="01:08:44.636" end="01:08:49.136" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am not tearing it. I sewed two loose</p>
<p begin="01:08:46.836" end="01:08:52.442" style="s2">beads back on at 3:00 in the morning, so</p>
<p begin="01:08:49.136" end="01:08:54.336" style="s2">I know exactly where it opens.</p>
<p begin="01:08:52.442" end="01:08:55.436" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:08:54.336" end="01:08:58.236" style="s2">Kena,</p>
<p begin="01:08:55.436" end="01:08:59.636" style="s2">you paid 15 million for this gown.</p>
<p begin="01:08:58.236" end="01:09:02.136" style="s2">Every bead</p>
<p begin="01:08:59.636" end="01:09:03.336" style="s2">every bead she told 3,000 people on her</p>
<p begin="01:09:02.136" end="01:09:04.736" style="s2">live.</p>
<p begin="01:09:03.336" end="01:09:08.036" style="s2">Read it with me.</p>
<p begin="01:09:04.736" end="01:09:13.536" style="s2">Bell Rose Bridal.</p>
<p begin="01:09:08.036" end="01:09:15.236" style="s2">Hire number 219 return Monday.</p>
<p begin="01:09:13.536" end="01:09:17.636" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That is a tailor&#39;s [music] tag. Every</p>
<p begin="01:09:15.236" end="01:09:20.636" style="s2">gown has a tag. She stitched it there</p>
<p begin="01:09:17.636" end="01:09:22.836" style="s2">herself to shame me.</p>
<p begin="01:09:20.636" end="01:09:25.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That label is mine. I own Bell Rose</p>
<p begin="01:09:22.836" end="01:09:27.538" style="s2">Bridal. 700,000 Naira hired by Miss</p>
<p begin="01:09:25.938" end="01:09:30.038" style="s2">Osagie.</p>
<p begin="01:09:27.538" end="01:09:33.038" style="s2">Due back on Monday, clean.</p>
<p begin="01:09:30.038" end="01:09:35.038" style="s2">Kena, it is clean because I washed it,</p>
<p begin="01:09:33.038" end="01:09:38.137" style="s2">bead by bead, the night she threw your</p>
<p begin="01:09:35.038" end="01:09:38.137" style="s2">mother into the rain.</p>
<p begin="01:09:38.538" end="01:09:42.938" style="s2">Cold water and a toothbrush until the</p>
<p begin="01:09:40.338" end="01:09:46.737" style="s2">sun came up because if one drop stayed,</p>
<p begin="01:09:42.938" end="01:09:46.737" style="s2">my mother&#39;s pot was going to the street.</p>
<p begin="01:09:47.438" end="01:09:51.338" style="s2">The pot went to the street anyway.</p>
<p begin="01:09:50.137" end="01:09:54.338" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zara,</p>
<p begin="01:09:51.338" end="01:09:55.938" style="s2">where did the 15 million go?</p>
<p begin="01:09:54.338" end="01:09:58.438" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Baby, this is how it is done now.</p>
<p begin="01:09:55.938" end="01:10:00.938" style="s2">Everybody hires first, then they buy</p>
<p begin="01:09:58.438" end="01:10:00.938" style="s2">after.</p>
<p begin="01:10:02.938" end="01:10:05.938" style="s2">Then let me tell him where the next</p>
<p begin="01:10:04.137" end="01:10:09.338" style="s2">money was going.</p>
<p begin="01:10:05.938" end="01:10:12.238" style="s2">On Thursday night on her balcony,</p>
<p begin="01:10:09.338" end="01:10:15.238" style="s2">on the phone she said it.</p>
<p begin="01:10:12.238" end="01:10:18.137" style="s2">Once I am his wife, the key is mine.</p>
<p begin="01:10:15.238" end="01:10:18.137" style="s2">Who told you that?</p>
<p begin="01:10:22.838" end="01:10:27.738" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who told you that?</p>
<p begin="01:10:24.738" end="01:10:27.738" style="s2">So she said it.</p>
<p begin="01:10:29.637" end="01:10:34.637" style="s2">60 million, Zara.</p>
<p begin="01:10:31.738" end="01:10:34.637" style="s2">Monday at noon.</p>
<p begin="01:10:35.137" end="01:10:39.838" style="s2">You swore to me that key would be in</p>
<p begin="01:10:36.438" end="01:10:39.838" style="s2">your hand before the cake was cut.</p>
<p begin="01:10:41.338" end="01:10:44.338" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kena, they are all lying. Your mother</p>
<p begin="01:10:42.938" end="01:10:48.738" style="s2">planned this with her from the first</p>
<p begin="01:10:44.338" end="01:10:48.738" style="s2">day. I slapped a maid who attacked me.</p>
<p begin="01:10:51.438" end="01:10:55.637" style="s2">I never deleted it.</p>
<p begin="01:10:53.338" end="01:10:58.338" style="s2">Kena, watch it. Imade fed me when you</p>
<p begin="01:10:55.637" end="01:10:58.338" style="s2">starved us.</p>
<p begin="01:11:09.838" end="01:11:14.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In a house 10 minutes from this hotel, a</p>
<p begin="01:11:12.438" end="01:11:17.438" style="s2">madam slapped a 19-year-old maid and put</p>
<p begin="01:11:14.938" end="01:11:20.038" style="s2">her out into the rain.</p>
<p begin="01:11:17.438" end="01:11:21.938" style="s2">Nobody in that kitchen moved.</p>
<p begin="01:11:20.038" end="01:11:23.438" style="s2">A woman selling soup at the junction</p>
<p begin="01:11:21.938" end="01:11:25.938" style="s2">opened her door,</p>
<p begin="01:11:23.438" end="01:11:26.938" style="s2">dried my hair, and fed me from her own</p>
<p begin="01:11:25.938" end="01:11:28.939" style="s2">pot.</p>
<p begin="01:11:26.938" end="01:11:30.639" style="s2">I swore that my son&#39;s wife would never</p>
<p begin="01:11:28.939" end="01:11:33.039" style="s2">be that madam.</p>
<p begin="01:11:30.639" end="01:11:35.539" style="s2">On Thursday, it happened again in this</p>
<p begin="01:11:33.039" end="01:11:39.139" style="s2">same city.</p>
<p begin="01:11:35.539" end="01:11:39.139" style="s2">The madam was wearing ivory.</p>
<p begin="01:11:39.939" end="01:11:44.239" style="s2">And the woman with the pot was Imade.</p>
<p begin="01:11:52.569" end="01:11:53.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:11:53.224" end="01:11:56.639" style="s2">[applause]</p>
<p begin="01:11:53.839" end="01:12:00.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There will be no wedding today.</p>
<p begin="01:11:56.639" end="01:12:04.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kenarubaby, 300 people are watching us.</p>
<p begin="01:12:00.939" end="01:12:04.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then 300 people heard you.</p>
<p begin="01:12:16.739" end="01:12:19.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My answer is no.</p>
<p begin="01:12:23.839" end="01:12:28.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Imade is my daughter,</p>
<p begin="01:12:26.139" end="01:12:31.539" style="s2">my first daughter.</p>
<p begin="01:12:28.339" end="01:12:34.739" style="s2">And last night, I put her in the rain</p>
<p begin="01:12:31.539" end="01:12:37.539" style="s2">with her mother&#39;s pot in the gutter.</p>
<p begin="01:12:34.739" end="01:12:39.639" style="s2">And I went back inside to eat.</p>
<p begin="01:12:37.539" end="01:12:41.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Osagie, sit down. You are disgracing</p>
<p begin="01:12:39.639" end="01:12:42.739" style="s2">this family in front of the whole of</p>
<p begin="01:12:41.039" end="01:12:46.539" style="s2">Benin.</p>
<p begin="01:12:42.739" end="01:12:49.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The keys of my house, Patience.</p>
<p begin="01:12:46.539" end="01:12:50.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here? In front of all these people?</p>
<p begin="01:12:49.139" end="01:12:54.539" style="s2">After four years in that house, you want</p>
<p begin="01:12:50.839" end="01:12:54.539" style="s2">to collect keys from me like a gate man?</p>
<p begin="01:13:05.839" end="01:13:10.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You and your daughter</p>
<p begin="01:13:07.639" end="01:13:12.939" style="s2">will not sleep under my roof</p>
<p begin="01:13:10.639" end="01:13:14.739" style="s2">until Esohe&#39;s pot stands at my gate</p>
<p begin="01:13:12.939" end="01:13:17.739" style="s2">again,</p>
<p begin="01:13:14.739" end="01:13:17.739" style="s2">built with your money</p>
<p begin="01:13:18.139" end="01:13:21.339" style="s2">and with your own hands.</p>
<p begin="01:13:31.475" end="01:13:33.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:13:33.740" end="01:13:38.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The car keys, Zara. The white one is</p>
<p begin="01:13:35.740" end="01:13:40.940" style="s2">mine until Monday. After Monday, we will</p>
<p begin="01:13:38.240" end="01:13:43.140" style="s2">discuss the rest.</p>
<p begin="01:13:40.940" end="01:13:44.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You cannot take my car in front of my</p>
<p begin="01:13:43.140" end="01:13:47.340" style="s2">guests.</p>
<p begin="01:13:44.540" end="01:13:49.940" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your guests [music] are leaving.</p>
<p begin="01:13:47.340" end="01:13:49.940" style="s2">The keys.</p>
<p begin="01:13:55.640" end="01:14:00.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One day, clean or 7 million.</p>
<p begin="01:14:00.951" end="01:14:02.971" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:14:04.240" end="01:14:09.140" style="s2">Waves. Wait for me, babe. Take me with</p>
<p begin="01:14:06.740" end="01:14:09.140" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:14:11.140" end="01:14:15.740" style="s2">Zara, my driver is waiting. Sorry, I</p>
<p begin="01:14:13.240" end="01:14:15.740" style="s2">have to go.</p>
<p begin="01:14:21.340" end="01:14:25.140" style="s2">Is this how you people leave us</p>
<p begin="01:14:23.440" end="01:14:27.440" style="s2">after everything my daughter did for</p>
<p begin="01:14:25.140" end="01:14:27.440" style="s2">you?</p>
<p begin="01:14:28.940" end="01:14:31.940" style="s2">Wait for me.</p>
<p begin="01:14:43.940" end="01:14:48.340" style="s2">Open this gate. I am the bride. Do you</p>
<p begin="01:14:46.440" end="01:14:50.940" style="s2">know who I am? Somebody bring me an</p>
<p begin="01:14:48.340" end="01:14:50.940" style="s2">umbrella.</p>
<p begin="01:14:51.640" end="01:14:57.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam, the gate is closed for the day.</p>
<p begin="01:14:53.940" end="01:14:57.240" style="s2">Please step back from the bars.</p>
<p begin="01:15:01.340" end="01:15:07.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My mother is in that car.</p>
<p begin="01:15:03.740" end="01:15:08.540" style="s2">My gown is inside this rain.</p>
<p begin="01:15:07.140" end="01:15:11.940" style="s2">Mommy.</p>
<p begin="01:15:08.540" end="01:15:11.940" style="s2">Mommy, come back for me.</p>
<p begin="01:15:14.440" end="01:15:19.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma, see now. Two people today my</p>
<p begin="01:15:17.240" end="01:15:21.240" style="s2">umbrella don&#39;t get promotion.</p>
<p begin="01:15:19.552" end="01:15:22.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:15:21.240" end="01:15:27.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Imade,</p>
<p begin="01:15:22.540" end="01:15:27.040" style="s2">sister, tell them to open, please.</p>
<p begin="01:15:32.640" end="01:15:36.342" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let the rain teach you, my dear.</p>
<p begin="01:16:04.842" end="01:16:10.642" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 38,000 Naira. I counted it three times.</p>
<p begin="01:16:07.942" end="01:16:13.142" style="s2">The rest I owe you is not money.</p>
<p begin="01:16:10.642" end="01:16:15.242" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You remembered the exact number, Papa?</p>
<p begin="01:16:13.142" end="01:16:16.442" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I remembered everything. I was only</p>
<p begin="01:16:15.242" end="01:16:19.742" style="s2">quiet.</p>
<p begin="01:16:16.442" end="01:16:21.942" style="s2">Come back into the house, Imade.</p>
<p begin="01:16:19.742" end="01:16:23.942" style="s2">I have had your old room upstairs</p>
<p begin="01:16:21.942" end="01:16:27.942" style="s2">painted.</p>
<p begin="01:16:23.942" end="01:16:27.942" style="s2">Sage, like your mother liked.</p>
<p begin="01:16:28.642" end="01:16:32.842" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will come for Sunday soup, Papa.</p>
<p begin="01:16:30.942" end="01:16:35.542" style="s2">I will cook it and you will sit down and</p>
<p begin="01:16:32.842" end="01:16:35.542" style="s2">eat it with me.</p>
<p begin="01:16:37.942" end="01:16:41.742" style="s2">And this time the cook sits down too.</p>
<p begin="01:16:44.942" end="01:16:48.542" style="s2">But I will not move back into that</p>
<p begin="01:16:46.242" end="01:16:50.542" style="s2">house, Papa. Not upstairs, not in the</p>
<p begin="01:16:48.542" end="01:16:51.742" style="s2">BQ.</p>
<p begin="01:16:50.542" end="01:16:55.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sunday then.</p>
<p begin="01:16:51.742" end="01:16:55.142" style="s2">I will bring the bowls myself.</p>
<p begin="01:17:05.242" end="01:17:12.642" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This was always for my son&#39;s wife.</p>
<p begin="01:17:09.042" end="01:17:12.642" style="s2">My son has no wife this year.</p>
<p begin="01:17:15.142" end="01:17:19.742" style="s2">So I am giving it to the woman who</p>
<p begin="01:17:16.942" end="01:17:19.742" style="s2">opened the door.</p>
<p begin="01:17:24.042" end="01:17:28.142" style="s2">I did not open my door to be paid, Mama.</p>
<p begin="01:17:34.342" end="01:17:39.543" style="s2">I knew you would say that, So I brought</p>
<p begin="01:17:36.743" end="01:17:39.543" style="s2">a second offer.</p>
<p begin="01:17:39.643" end="01:17:43.843" style="s2">Then work for me.</p>
<p begin="01:17:41.743" end="01:17:46.443" style="s2">My head chefs tasted your banga blind</p>
<p begin="01:17:43.843" end="01:17:47.583" style="s2">against their own, all four of them.</p>
<p begin="01:17:46.443" end="01:17:49.603" style="s2">You won.</p>
<p begin="01:17:47.583" end="01:17:49.603" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:17:50.743" end="01:17:55.443" style="s2">Cook the soup counter at Neoma&#39;s table,</p>
<p begin="01:17:53.443" end="01:17:57.343" style="s2">Neoma&#39;s table</p>
<p begin="01:17:55.443" end="01:18:00.343" style="s2">under your mother&#39;s name</p>
<p begin="01:17:57.343" end="01:18:00.343" style="s2">at your price.</p>
<p begin="01:18:00.543" end="01:18:04.743" style="s2">At my price.</p>
<p begin="01:18:02.643" end="01:18:06.243" style="s2">Two things.</p>
<p begin="01:18:04.743" end="01:18:07.943" style="s2">My mother&#39;s name hangs over that</p>
<p begin="01:18:06.243" end="01:18:10.543" style="s2">counter. My mother&#39;s name hangs over</p>
<p begin="01:18:07.943" end="01:18:12.643" style="s2">that counter.</p>
<p begin="01:18:10.543" end="01:18:14.343" style="s2">And every Saturday morning, this kiosk</p>
<p begin="01:18:12.643" end="01:18:16.043" style="s2">opens at my father&#39;s and my father&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:18:14.343" end="01:18:18.243" style="s2">gate</p>
<p begin="01:18:16.043" end="01:18:20.843" style="s2">because hungry people do not use the</p>
<p begin="01:18:18.243" end="01:18:20.843" style="s2">back door.</p>
<p begin="01:18:22.843" end="01:18:27.043" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Imade, the queue has reached the</p>
<p begin="01:18:24.343" end="01:18:29.943" style="s2">junction. Are you open or not?</p>
<p begin="01:18:27.043" end="01:18:29.943" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We are open.</p>
<p begin="01:18:42.943" end="01:18:46.443" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No more tests, mommy. Next time you want</p>
<p begin="01:18:44.843" end="01:18:49.043" style="s2">to know a girl, you knock on her front</p>
<p begin="01:18:46.443" end="01:18:51.343" style="s2">door and you ask me.</p>
<p begin="01:18:49.043" end="01:18:52.643" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No more uniforms, I promise, in front of</p>
<p begin="01:18:51.343" end="01:18:53.543" style="s2">witnesses.</p>
<p begin="01:18:52.643" end="01:18:58.043" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma,</p>
<p begin="01:18:53.543" end="01:18:58.043" style="s2">the uniform is in my boot in case.</p>
<p begin="01:18:58.943" end="01:19:03.343" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lucky.</p>
<p begin="01:19:00.943" end="01:19:05.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am going, ma. Me and the tray, we are</p>
<p begin="01:19:03.343" end="01:19:07.549" style="s2">going.</p>
<p begin="01:19:05.529" end="01:19:07.549" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:19:09.643" end="01:19:12.443" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait, Lucky.</p>
<p begin="01:19:10.943" end="01:19:13.543" style="s2">The airport behind my mother&#39;s phone</p>
<p begin="01:19:12.443" end="01:19:15.543" style="s2">call,</p>
<p begin="01:19:13.543" end="01:19:17.443" style="s2">the announcement was YouTube, you told</p>
<p begin="01:19:15.543" end="01:19:19.043" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="01:19:17.443" end="01:19:21.943" style="s2">But that man shouting final call for</p>
<p begin="01:19:19.043" end="01:19:21.943" style="s2">Lagos, that was you?</p>
<p begin="01:19:22.943" end="01:19:27.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, I have a very fine airport voice.</p>
<p begin="01:19:25.343" end="01:19:29.820" style="s2">British Airways no fit do am better.</p>
<p begin="01:19:27.800" end="01:19:29.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:19:31.743" end="01:19:37.943" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Two weeks ago, at my car,</p>
<p begin="01:19:34.343" end="01:19:37.943" style="s2">I said you never told me who you were.</p>
<p begin="01:19:38.143" end="01:19:43.244" style="s2">The The is I never asked.</p>
<p begin="01:19:41.045" end="01:19:46.045" style="s2">A whole year on your bench, and I never</p>
<p begin="01:19:43.244" end="01:19:46.045" style="s2">once asked.</p>
<p begin="01:19:49.945" end="01:19:56.244" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come and eat first, then we will see.</p>
<p begin="01:19:53.244" end="01:19:56.244" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is this still 2,000?</p>
<p begin="01:19:59.744" end="01:20:02.844" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At the gate, yes. In here you pay</p>
<p begin="01:20:01.445" end="01:20:05.144" style="s2">restaurant price [music] like everybody</p>
<p begin="01:20:02.844" end="01:20:05.144" style="s2">else.</p>
<p begin="01:20:09.545" end="01:20:12.744" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It tastes like the bench.</p>
<p begin="01:20:14.144" end="01:20:17.445" style="s2">Exactly like the bench.</p>
<p begin="01:20:17.945" end="01:20:24.445" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It is the same pot and the same oil</p>
<p begin="01:20:20.844" end="01:20:27.844" style="s2">cooked with the same patience.</p>
<p begin="01:20:24.445" end="01:20:29.644" style="s2">Only the chairs in here cost more.</p>
<p begin="01:20:27.844" end="01:20:32.844" style="s2">Whatever my son decides, you have a</p>
<p begin="01:20:29.644" end="01:20:32.844" style="s2">family at this table.</p>
<p begin="01:20:34.344" end="01:20:37.644" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I belong somewhere, mama.</p>
<p begin="01:20:57.945" end="01:21:03.244" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry, ma. I am going now. I only wanted</p>
<p begin="01:21:00.545" end="01:21:06.445" style="s2">the rain to slow down small.</p>
<p begin="01:21:03.244" end="01:21:06.445" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who put you out in this weather?</p>
<p begin="01:21:08.244" end="01:21:12.144" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My madam.</p>
<p begin="01:21:09.945" end="01:21:15.744" style="s2">A glass broke in her kitchen,</p>
<p begin="01:21:12.144" end="01:21:15.744" style="s2">and she said I have village hands.</p>
<p begin="01:21:17.644" end="01:21:22.244" style="s2">She locked the gate behind me, and my</p>
<p begin="01:21:19.644" end="01:21:23.744" style="s2">bus fare is inside the house.</p>
<p begin="01:21:22.244" end="01:21:27.244" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then you will not stand here until</p>
<p begin="01:21:23.744" end="01:21:27.244" style="s2">morning. Come under this.</p>
<p begin="01:21:37.545" end="01:21:41.345" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma, I cannot come inside a place like</p>
<p begin="01:21:39.344" end="01:21:43.745" style="s2">this. Look at me. I will wet your whole</p>
<p begin="01:21:41.345" end="01:21:43.745" style="s2">floor.</p>
<p begin="01:21:47.546" end="01:21:52.845" style="s2">Floor is dry.</p>
<p begin="01:21:49.446" end="01:21:54.345" style="s2">I have mopped worse things than rain.</p>
<p begin="01:21:52.845" end="01:21:56.745" style="s2">And there is soup still warm on the</p>
<p begin="01:21:54.345" end="01:21:57.646" style="s2">counter.</p>
<p begin="01:21:56.745" end="01:21:59.446" style="s2">Ma,</p>
<p begin="01:21:57.646" end="01:22:01.946" style="s2">your wrapper will spoil.</p>
<p begin="01:21:59.446" end="01:22:04.745" style="s2">Why are you opening for me?</p>
<p begin="01:22:01.946" end="01:22:04.745" style="s2">You don&#39;t know me.</p>
<p begin="01:22:07.245" end="01:22:11.345" style="s2">I know you are wet.</p>
<p begin="01:22:09.046" end="01:22:13.245" style="s2">The rest can wait until you are dry.</p>
<p begin="01:22:11.345" end="01:22:16.946" style="s2">Come in.</p>
<p begin="01:22:13.245" end="01:22:16.946" style="s2">Rain shows you who is family.</p>
<p begin="01:22:24.652" end="01:22:26.672" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
